WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Downloaded from CINEFREAK.NET

00:01:06.463 --> 00:01:08.383
To prove that
the election was rigged,

00:01:08.716 --> 00:01:10.230
one person's testimony
isn't enough.

00:01:12.296 --> 00:01:13.230
Sudalai,

00:01:13.346 --> 00:01:15.050
how many people did you say
you saw Sasi bribing?

00:01:15.110 --> 00:01:16.110
Twenty-five people.

00:01:16.153 --> 00:01:17.473
I remember where
all of them live.

00:01:17.556 --> 00:01:19.171
We have a video of his associate

00:01:19.254 --> 00:01:20.650
admitting that Pandiyaraj
paid them. Isn't that enough?

00:01:20.733 --> 00:01:23.156
No, Sudalai.
It's strong evidence,

00:01:23.363 --> 00:01:25.563
but this alone isn't enough
to prove he committed fraud.

00:01:25.896 --> 00:01:27.176
We must prove that he brought in

00:01:27.216 --> 00:01:28.807
25 people like these
to win the election.

00:01:28.907 --> 00:01:30.060
Exactly.

00:01:30.710 --> 00:01:32.510
To do that, we need details
about all of them.

00:01:32.723 --> 00:01:34.051
Only then can we prove it
to the committee

00:01:34.091 --> 00:01:35.411
and have those votes
disqualified.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:36.530
Deva..

00:01:36.683 --> 00:01:38.200
Do you realise
how much work this will take?

00:01:38.283 --> 00:01:40.803
Meanwhile, Karunakaran
has sent us so many files.

00:01:41.023 --> 00:01:42.543
I have no idea what to do.

00:01:42.756 --> 00:01:45.003
Come on, let's go tell everyone.
- Hey, wait.

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:47.016
First, we need solid evidence.

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:48.410
Let's not tell anyone
about this.

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:51.007
Pandiyaraj will be keeping
a close eye on all of us.

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:53.290
If we all act together,
he'll definitely get suspicious.

00:01:53.523 --> 00:01:54.843
Yes, that's true.

00:01:56.123 --> 00:01:57.767
Even if this information
leaks out,

00:01:57.850 --> 00:01:59.977
he'll be alerted
and destroy all the evidence.

00:02:00.676 --> 00:02:03.090
Yazhini, focus on the case.
I'll handle this.

00:02:03.683 --> 00:02:04.803
How can you handle it alone?

00:02:04.893 --> 00:02:06.973
Amreen is here, isn't she?
We'll handle it together.

00:02:08.176 --> 00:02:09.217
Amreen?

00:02:10.896 --> 00:02:11.976
All right, let's go.
- Okay.

00:02:17.316 --> 00:02:18.763
Oh, so it's Amreen, is it?

00:02:57.028 --> 00:02:59.115
How does it feel now, sir?

00:03:00.475 --> 00:03:03.242
There's nothing like the thrill
of holding this position.

00:03:03.535 --> 00:03:05.408
You've finally become president,
just as you wanted.

00:03:05.448 --> 00:03:06.705
You're happy now,
aren't you, sir?

00:03:06.745 --> 00:03:08.797
We worked so hard
to win this election.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:10.561
I'm very happy now, sir.

00:03:11.761 --> 00:03:13.735
Not entirely.

00:03:14.722 --> 00:03:16.628
There's still one little matter
to take care of.

00:03:16.988 --> 00:03:18.908
What is it, sir?
- Where's Veni?

00:03:41.286 --> 00:03:43.819
'You want to bring
Karunakaran down, don't you?'

00:03:44.373 --> 00:03:46.141
'Yes. What does that
have to do with this?'

00:03:46.224 --> 00:03:48.833
'It is connected.
Karunakaran once

00:03:48.919 --> 00:03:50.933
took on a case against
Maaran Associates.'

00:03:51.066 --> 00:03:52.666
'It was a case involving
illegal mining.'

00:03:52.759 --> 00:03:55.439
'The documents he received
came in five lorries.'

00:03:55.753 --> 00:03:57.066
'Five lorries?
- Yes.'

00:03:57.299 --> 00:04:00.572
'It took six months just to sort
and organise those documents.'

00:04:00.726 --> 00:04:03.046
'So, if you want to defeat
Karunakaran in the future,

00:04:03.233 --> 00:04:05.099
you must learn to do this
without complaining.'

00:04:06.893 --> 00:04:08.533
Why are you standing here
lost in thought?

00:04:10.346 --> 00:04:12.626
What are you thinking about?
It's nothing.

00:04:14.813 --> 00:04:15.813
By the way...

00:04:16.486 --> 00:04:17.759
Why do you look so down?

00:04:18.919 --> 00:04:20.873
I thought Ms. Veni would
somehow manage to win.

00:04:21.139 --> 00:04:23.493
But now she's lost.
What can we do now?

00:04:24.033 --> 00:04:25.033
Forget it.

00:04:25.219 --> 00:04:26.746
Anything can happen from now on.

00:04:27.173 --> 00:04:28.332
What else could happen?

00:04:28.432 --> 00:04:30.294
That man won
and became President.

00:04:30.573 --> 00:04:31.906
Who knows what he'll do next?

00:04:32.393 --> 00:04:34.086
No. I mean,

00:04:34.566 --> 00:04:35.926
anything could happen
from here on.

00:04:37.333 --> 00:04:39.073
"Anything could happen
from now on"?

00:04:39.439 --> 00:04:42.033
You know something, don't you?
Tell me what it is.

00:04:42.333 --> 00:04:44.146
Hey.. It's nothing.

00:04:44.446 --> 00:04:45.961
Look at how many files
there are.

00:04:46.061 --> 00:04:47.269
Give me a hand with these.

00:04:47.369 --> 00:04:49.826
Don't try to distract me
by making me handle these files.

00:04:50.072 --> 00:04:51.939
Tell me the truth.
What do you know?

00:04:56.326 --> 00:04:57.326
Diversion.

00:04:57.893 --> 00:04:59.533
Diversion? What?

00:05:05.149 --> 00:05:06.973
'She handed me these files
while she was talking.'

00:05:07.056 --> 00:05:09.770
'Take them. She's always
making me do her work.'

00:05:21.016 --> 00:05:22.016
Diversion.

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.320
'Everyone in this court knows'

00:05:25.176 --> 00:05:26.376
that Ms. Veni deserved to win.

00:05:27.183 --> 00:05:28.463
But then how did he win,
Sathyan?

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:31.363
To be fair,
she should be the President.

00:05:34.509 --> 00:05:36.529
With so much support
on our side, how did he win?

00:05:37.056 --> 00:05:38.456
There was definitely
some foul play.

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:40.736
I knew it all along.

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:43.170
He's no ordinary man.

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:46.030
I knew he'd pull
some dirty trick.

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:47.570
Just as I expected..

00:05:54.955 --> 00:05:56.926
Hey.
- Why are you so quiet?

00:05:57.009 --> 00:05:57.888
It's nothing, Sathyan.

00:05:57.971 --> 00:05:59.559
If you have something to say,
just say it.

00:05:59.642 --> 00:06:00.675
No, nothing.

00:06:02.568 --> 00:06:04.312
Pandiyaraj throws
his weight around as it is.

00:06:04.395 --> 00:06:05.755
And now he's won
the election, too.

00:06:06.055 --> 00:06:07.368
Who knows what he'll do next?

00:06:11.344 --> 00:06:13.484
When we filed our nominations
for this election,

00:06:14.024 --> 00:06:16.924
did we expect to get
so many votes?

00:06:17.684 --> 00:06:18.684
And yet today,

00:06:19.244 --> 00:06:21.604
so many people trusted us enough
to vote for us.

00:06:23.185 --> 00:06:24.958
So what if we didn't win this time?

00:06:24.998 --> 00:06:28.004
We'll work even harder
and try again next time.

00:06:28.618 --> 00:06:29.618
No, ma'am.

00:06:30.578 --> 00:06:31.604
I understand.

00:06:32.218 --> 00:06:33.218
Now,

00:06:33.758 --> 00:06:35.598
we have to accept reality.

00:06:37.698 --> 00:06:38.698
From now on,

00:06:39.184 --> 00:06:42.031
we just have to carry on
with our work as usual.

00:06:42.991 --> 00:06:43.991
How can we do that?

00:06:44.457 --> 00:06:45.771
Will he even let us work?

00:06:45.998 --> 00:06:48.744
I'm not worried about myself.
I can handle him.

00:06:49.684 --> 00:06:50.684
But

00:06:51.331 --> 00:06:53.358
I don't want anything
to happen to my juniors.

00:06:56.024 --> 00:06:57.878
Their futures are at stake.

00:06:58.485 --> 00:06:59.485
That's why I'm saying

00:06:59.938 --> 00:07:01.938
we should let this matter rest.
- All right, ma'am.

00:07:02.658 --> 00:07:03.761
We'll face
whatever comes our way.

00:07:03.844 --> 00:07:04.844
You're right.

00:07:05.771 --> 00:07:07.251
Until now, you've been
standing alone.

00:07:07.591 --> 00:07:09.878
Now you have all of us
behind you. We'll handle it.

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:13.420
All right.

00:07:13.624 --> 00:07:15.131
Now, get back to work.

00:07:15.711 --> 00:07:18.165
Whatever happens,
we'll face it together.

00:07:18.414 --> 00:07:19.860
Okay?
- Okay, ma'am.

00:07:28.862 --> 00:07:29.862
Deva,

00:07:30.635 --> 00:07:31.995
I need to talk to you
for a moment.

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:39.320
Yazhini,

00:07:39.419 --> 00:07:41.486
why did you bring me here
instead of working on the files?

00:07:41.569 --> 00:07:43.789
Deva, I was going
through the files,

00:07:44.415 --> 00:07:46.109
but then I remembered
something you said.

00:07:46.269 --> 00:07:47.269
What is it?

00:07:47.349 --> 00:07:48.752
You told me the other day,
remember?

00:07:48.852 --> 00:07:49.769
In Karunakaran's mining case,

00:07:50.215 --> 00:07:51.243
five lorries of files
were sent to him,

00:07:51.326 --> 00:07:53.253
and he won by delaying
the case for six months.

00:07:53.522 --> 00:07:54.522
Yes.

00:07:55.069 --> 00:07:56.309
He's doing the same thing here!

00:07:57.162 --> 00:07:59.869
He sent us lorry-loads of files
just two days before our hearing

00:08:00.195 --> 00:08:01.475
to distract us.

00:08:02.709 --> 00:08:04.409
Yazhini, you're right,

00:08:04.842 --> 00:08:07.449
but this is the only lead we have.

00:08:08.875 --> 00:08:10.235
I've been thinking
about that, too.

00:08:13.019 --> 00:08:14.513
Wait. The money!

00:08:15.481 --> 00:08:16.481
What?

00:08:18.386 --> 00:08:20.366
These shell companies
received loans from banks.

00:08:22.229 --> 00:08:23.229
Yes.

00:08:24.286 --> 00:08:26.292
The loan amounts must have been
deposited into their accounts,

00:08:26.332 --> 00:08:27.332
right?

00:08:27.906 --> 00:08:29.773
Correct.
- Then where did the money go?

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:31.480
How was it transferred?

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:34.620
How quickly was it transferred?
Can we find that out?

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:42.941
We can find out

00:08:42.981 --> 00:08:44.542
by checking those companies'
bank statements.

00:08:44.642 --> 00:08:45.890
Exactly.

00:08:47.052 --> 00:08:48.052
Brilliant, Deva!

00:08:48.499 --> 00:08:49.700
I'll check all of that right away.

00:08:49.740 --> 00:08:50.760
Yeah.

00:09:02.672 --> 00:09:04.872
How long are you going
to stand there looking so gloomy?

00:09:05.512 --> 00:09:07.072
Go take care of the work
in the canteen.

00:09:12.176 --> 00:09:13.208
Ma'am,

00:09:13.248 --> 00:09:15.445
it feels like we were treated
unfairly in this election.

00:09:15.528 --> 00:09:17.223
We're all going
on strike together.

00:09:17.306 --> 00:09:18.966
Yes, we'll all go
on strike together.

00:09:21.022 --> 00:09:23.482
I understand that
you're all disappointed,

00:09:23.988 --> 00:09:26.815
but if we strike
without evidence,

00:09:27.095 --> 00:09:30.068
they'll simply say
we can't accept defeat.

00:09:30.342 --> 00:09:31.488
No, we can't do that.

00:09:31.697 --> 00:09:33.812
But, ma'am, we can't let
Pandiyaraj get away with this.

00:09:33.895 --> 00:09:35.215
We shouldn't let him
off the hook,

00:09:36.235 --> 00:09:38.862
but we must challenge him
through the proper channels.

00:09:39.635 --> 00:09:41.422
Use your power wisely.

00:09:41.635 --> 00:09:44.122
When there's a genuine cause,
we must protest.

00:09:44.628 --> 00:09:47.348
Then, step up and go on strike.
Protest peacefully

00:09:47.668 --> 00:09:48.668
for our rights.

00:09:49.755 --> 00:09:52.615
But not now. Please understand.

00:10:04.795 --> 00:10:07.221
I told you this would happen.

00:10:07.701 --> 00:10:09.548
Now you have
nowhere left to turn.

00:10:09.861 --> 00:10:10.895
If you want, apologise to me

00:10:10.935 --> 00:10:13.595
and say you didn't realise
what you were doing.

00:10:14.068 --> 00:10:15.901
I'll consider forgiving you.

00:10:16.915 --> 00:10:20.015
From now on, every minute
you spend in this court,

00:10:20.675 --> 00:10:24.095
you'll regret ever daring
to stand up against me.

00:10:25.408 --> 00:10:26.995
You've said too much.

00:10:27.248 --> 00:10:29.175
Let's see how your son
ever becomes a lawyer.

00:10:30.515 --> 00:10:33.328
Forget that.
How will you earn a living?

00:10:33.368 --> 00:10:34.928
You won't even have
the canteen anymore.

00:10:35.348 --> 00:10:38.875
You and your son can open
a little shop outside the court.

00:10:39.981 --> 00:10:41.775
Sir, I shouldn't have
spoken out of turn.

00:10:42.395 --> 00:10:44.548
Please don't ruin
my son's future, sir. I beg you.

00:10:48.421 --> 00:10:51.101
You've always wanted someone
to beg you like this.

00:10:51.608 --> 00:10:52.608
What?

00:10:52.995 --> 00:10:55.081
I'm not someone who'll be
intimidated by your threats.

00:10:55.121 --> 00:10:57.172
Take your threats elsewhere.
Get out.

00:10:57.255 --> 00:11:00.335
Hey! Who are you talking to?
- Sasi..

00:11:00.895 --> 00:11:02.148
Let it go. Let it go.

00:11:03.135 --> 00:11:05.415
It's only for today, isn't it?
Let him talk. Just let him.

00:11:06.634 --> 00:11:08.588
Even after losing,
you haven't lost your arrogance.

00:11:08.628 --> 00:11:09.628
I'll deal with you.

00:11:31.264 --> 00:11:32.193
What?

00:11:32.233 --> 00:11:34.713
You know the election was rigged,

00:11:35.006 --> 00:11:37.973
yet you and Deva are acting
as if nothing happened?

00:11:39.666 --> 00:11:40.899
"I'll handle it with Amreen."

00:11:41.146 --> 00:11:43.233
You heard him say that, didn't you?

00:11:43.805 --> 00:11:44.805
Just look at him.

00:11:49.393 --> 00:11:51.473
Looks like someone's burning
with a little jealousy.

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:54.740
Jealous? Me?

00:11:55.666 --> 00:11:56.699
Why would I be jealous?

00:12:00.308 --> 00:12:02.354
If you go too far,
I'll tell Sathyan about you.

00:12:02.548 --> 00:12:04.348
Go ahead. Tell him.
What do I care?

00:12:05.108 --> 00:12:07.228
I'll tell him everything.
You'll be the one who loses.

00:12:07.455 --> 00:12:08.974
I'm acting cool, too.

00:12:10.268 --> 00:12:11.268
I'm always like this.

00:12:28.084 --> 00:12:29.084
Oh!

00:12:31.927 --> 00:12:33.800
Yazhini, Mr. Pandiyaraj
wants to see you.

00:12:36.207 --> 00:12:37.221
Me?
- Yes.

00:12:42.604 --> 00:12:44.031
Why does he want to see me?

00:12:54.022 --> 00:12:56.142
Shailu, wait here for a moment.
I'll be right back.

00:13:17.485 --> 00:13:18.485
Sathyan..

00:13:20.692 --> 00:13:22.585
I knew I'd find you like this.

00:13:25.049 --> 00:13:26.969
Principles, ethics, idealism..

00:13:27.052 --> 00:13:28.572
They all sound good
in theory, Sathyan,

00:13:28.662 --> 00:13:30.142
but they don't work
in the real world.

00:13:31.049 --> 00:13:32.522
If you want to rise to the top,

00:13:33.015 --> 00:13:34.629
you've got to be ruthless.

00:13:35.662 --> 00:13:36.722
To be in power,

00:13:37.729 --> 00:13:39.462
you have to pay a price.

00:13:40.889 --> 00:13:44.162
If I'd let things go
the way you did,

00:13:44.908 --> 00:13:46.295
RSK Firm

00:13:46.649 --> 00:13:49.175
wouldn't be one of India's
leading firms today.

00:13:49.595 --> 00:13:53.048
I'd have ended up sitting under
a tree, or who knows where else.

00:13:53.762 --> 00:13:55.882
Do you remember
what Mr. Krishnamurthy said?

00:13:56.929 --> 00:13:58.789
"Whatever is necessary is dharma."

00:13:59.536 --> 00:14:01.656
There's no such thing as
right or wrong here, Sathyan.

00:14:01.989 --> 00:14:04.309
I hope you finally
understand that.

00:14:05.049 --> 00:14:06.835
At least teach your juniors
this lesson.

00:14:07.102 --> 00:14:08.822
Let them get ahead in life,
at least.

00:14:10.815 --> 00:14:11.815
Mr. Raj Sekar.

00:14:15.029 --> 00:14:17.029
Even though Veni lost,
some people have come forward

00:14:17.112 --> 00:14:18.392
to support her and stand by her.

00:14:19.435 --> 00:14:21.195
They're even willing
to go on strike for her.

00:14:21.556 --> 00:14:22.856
If we follow your advice,

00:14:23.062 --> 00:14:25.615
we might gain status,
power and money.

00:14:26.229 --> 00:14:27.942
But what about respect?
Never.

00:14:29.189 --> 00:14:31.302
Respect shouldn't
come from fear.

00:14:32.075 --> 00:14:33.516
It should be earned
through one's actions.

00:14:33.616 --> 00:14:34.802
So what?

00:14:34.902 --> 00:14:37.462
What's the point of that?
Will that change the verdict?

00:14:38.282 --> 00:14:40.242
At the end of the day,
results matter.

00:14:40.862 --> 00:14:42.143
Even if you lose
by just one vote,

00:14:42.226 --> 00:14:43.771
the world sees the loser
as nothing but a failure.

00:14:43.854 --> 00:14:45.613
In fact, it won't even
remember the loser.

00:14:46.555 --> 00:14:48.415
As far as I'm concerned,
you two are

00:14:48.809 --> 00:14:50.529
the biggest failures.

00:14:51.349 --> 00:14:53.082
And that is a fact.

00:14:53.822 --> 00:14:55.175
You still don't understand.

00:14:55.915 --> 00:14:57.735
The only reason
people respect you

00:14:58.029 --> 00:14:59.955
is the position you hold.

00:15:01.242 --> 00:15:03.089
Not who you are as a person.

00:15:03.638 --> 00:15:04.638
Veni..

00:15:04.795 --> 00:15:08.302
Our position determines
who we are.

00:15:08.529 --> 00:15:09.662
That position you mentioned

00:15:10.262 --> 00:15:12.129
is exactly what I set
out to achieve.

00:15:13.589 --> 00:15:14.789
Just for the sake of argument,

00:15:15.335 --> 00:15:17.062
ask a hundred people
here this question.

00:15:17.535 --> 00:15:18.955
"Who do you want to be like?"

00:15:19.422 --> 00:15:21.755
Ninety-nine of them will say
they want to be like me.

00:15:21.949 --> 00:15:23.149
Because I am their aspiration.

00:15:23.649 --> 00:15:25.762
Their dream is to be like me.

00:15:26.222 --> 00:15:27.622
No one would want to be
like Sathyan

00:15:27.709 --> 00:15:29.622
or Veni.

00:15:30.295 --> 00:15:31.295
Why go that far?

00:15:31.495 --> 00:15:32.815
Ask your juniors yourself.

00:15:34.402 --> 00:15:36.135
Because you haven't
understood this,

00:15:36.462 --> 00:15:38.095
you've been stuck here
for twenty years.

00:15:38.669 --> 00:15:40.289
You'll never get anywhere
in life.

00:15:41.842 --> 00:15:43.082
Because of you, an innocent man

00:15:43.635 --> 00:15:45.229
has spent 20 years in prison.

00:15:46.142 --> 00:15:47.375
How do you sleep at night?

00:15:47.528 --> 00:15:48.888
Doesn't your conscience
bother you?

00:15:50.115 --> 00:15:51.735
He wasn't my client.

00:15:52.175 --> 00:15:54.395
My duty is to defend my client.

00:15:54.775 --> 00:15:57.069
My client is now the CEO
of a business empire

00:15:57.422 --> 00:15:58.962
worth ₹3,000 crore.

00:16:01.949 --> 00:16:02.975
We studied law

00:16:03.609 --> 00:16:05.149
to secure justice
for innocent people.

00:16:05.449 --> 00:16:07.402
That's our duty.
- Wrong!

00:16:08.289 --> 00:16:10.682
Securing justice
isn't a lawyer's job.

00:16:10.936 --> 00:16:12.869
That's the responsibility
of this honourable court.

00:16:12.909 --> 00:16:14.406
That's why we have judges,
police officers,

00:16:14.446 --> 00:16:15.795
and thousands of others
working in the system.

00:16:15.835 --> 00:16:18.469
It's the responsibility
of the entire system.

00:16:18.509 --> 00:16:19.822
A lawyer's duty

00:16:20.115 --> 00:16:21.882
is to defend their client.

00:16:22.049 --> 00:16:23.795
Even if the client
is in the wrong,

00:16:24.175 --> 00:16:27.175
a lawyer must build
an airtight defence.

00:16:27.315 --> 00:16:28.589
That's a lawyer's duty.

00:16:28.902 --> 00:16:31.262
That's all.
Nothing more and nothing less.

00:16:31.575 --> 00:16:33.295
Evidence is enough
for the honourable court,

00:16:33.942 --> 00:16:35.322
but is it enough
for one's conscience?

00:16:35.362 --> 00:16:37.282
You have to answer
to your conscience, don't you?

00:16:37.509 --> 00:16:40.062
Sathyan, what pricks you
isn't your conscience.

00:16:40.602 --> 00:16:43.782
It's your saviour complex.
You wanted to save someone

00:16:44.042 --> 00:16:45.829
and worked towards it,
but failed,

00:16:46.135 --> 00:16:47.612
then ran away and abandoned
this profession.

00:16:47.695 --> 00:16:48.850
Just because you won,

00:16:48.933 --> 00:16:50.562
that doesn't make
everything you say right.

00:16:50.602 --> 00:16:52.435
I never wanted to be right.

00:16:52.929 --> 00:16:53.929
You know what?

00:16:54.302 --> 00:16:55.535
I just want to be the best.

00:16:57.769 --> 00:16:58.769
Guess what?

00:16:59.215 --> 00:17:00.215
I am the best.

00:17:16.442 --> 00:17:17.490
Is contesting

00:17:17.610 --> 00:17:18.975
the association election a crime?

00:17:19.015 --> 00:17:20.527
Senior,
why are they targeting us

00:17:20.567 --> 00:17:21.849
and attacking us like this?

00:17:21.949 --> 00:17:24.402
First, Pandiyaraj,
and now Raj Sekar.

00:17:24.602 --> 00:17:26.209
What do they think we are?

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:30.454
Ms. Veni only wanted
to do good for all of us.

00:17:30.633 --> 00:17:32.433
Is that such a big mistake?
- It is a mistake.

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:34.346
If you try to do good,
this is how people treat you.

00:17:34.386 --> 00:17:36.867
We should have left them alone
to ruin themselves.

00:17:37.133 --> 00:17:39.573
324 people voted for us,
didn't they?

00:17:40.287 --> 00:17:41.327
Then don't talk like that.

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:42.930
Yes.

00:17:43.087 --> 00:17:45.007
We lost by only 15 votes.

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:46.360
We still lost.

00:17:46.867 --> 00:17:48.131
Didn't Raj Sekar say,

00:17:48.231 --> 00:17:49.796
"In the end, results matter"?

00:17:52.147 --> 00:17:54.620
Pandiyaraj scares me, Muthu.

00:17:59.227 --> 00:18:01.347
What's wrong with you?
- Well..

00:18:03.614 --> 00:18:06.434
I don't even mind
that we lost, but..

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:08.787
I couldn't bear seeing
Ms. Veni standing there

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:10.510
with her head bowed
before everyone.

00:18:12.693 --> 00:18:14.493
No matter how much
we expose Pandiyaraj,

00:18:14.947 --> 00:18:16.307
how did he still
get so many votes?

00:18:16.473 --> 00:18:17.882
Senior, what's there
to understand?

00:18:17.965 --> 00:18:19.646
He has plenty of money,
and we don't.

00:18:19.763 --> 00:18:21.123
That's all there is to it.
Simple.

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:34.240
Why is he coming over here?
- Amreen,

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:37.000
come with me for a moment.

00:18:38.927 --> 00:18:42.406
What is it, Deva?
- Yazhini is a little busy.

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:44.520
I need your help.

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:49.520
I know why you're all
looking at me with suspicion,

00:18:49.786 --> 00:18:51.693
but trust me, guys.

00:19:35.740 --> 00:19:37.407
It seems RS might be right.

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:40.400
Just as he said,

00:19:41.973 --> 00:19:42.973
we're the ones who lost.

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:45.500
That's the truth.

00:19:48.533 --> 00:19:49.533
Yes.

00:19:51.533 --> 00:19:52.580
But not forever.

00:19:54.713 --> 00:19:56.113
Those who want to do
good for people

00:19:56.693 --> 00:19:58.293
keep falling.

00:20:00.893 --> 00:20:02.040
Those who do good
will naturally have

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:03.080
more enemies here, won't they?

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:06.800
As long as we don't
give up on ourselves,

00:20:08.673 --> 00:20:09.707
we haven't lost, Veni.

00:20:13.933 --> 00:20:14.933
Then..

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:16.793
why did you give up?

00:20:17.587 --> 00:20:19.893
You could have stayed
and fought, couldn't you?

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:21.760
I didn't give up.

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:23.460
I threw it all away.

00:20:24.873 --> 00:20:26.540
Someone who trusted me
lost their life.

00:20:29.073 --> 00:20:30.453
Raj Sekar's betrayal

00:20:30.987 --> 00:20:33.447
and the pain it caused.
I couldn't recover from it.

00:20:34.002 --> 00:20:35.002
That's why..

00:20:35.747 --> 00:20:36.920
I threw everything away.

00:20:40.233 --> 00:20:41.913
Is that why you
abandoned me and left, too?

00:20:48.626 --> 00:20:50.880
I.. was only joking.

00:20:52.813 --> 00:20:55.133
Even if you were joking,
your anger is justified, right?

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:56.826
I'm not angry with you.

00:20:59.806 --> 00:21:00.993
You believe in God.

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:04.073
I just can't bring myself
to believe.

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:07.773
If God really existed,

00:21:09.233 --> 00:21:10.613
would this have happened
to Vidya?

00:21:11.186 --> 00:21:13.259
And besides,
after everything he's done,

00:21:13.473 --> 00:21:15.613
how can Pandiyaraj be sitting
in that chair again?

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:18.174
Things like this keep happening,
don't they?

00:21:18.254 --> 00:21:21.540
Veni, how can we blame God when
it's people who do these things?

00:21:22.153 --> 00:21:23.713
If He had to intervene
in every problem,

00:21:24.426 --> 00:21:26.026
what would be the point of us
being here?

00:21:26.706 --> 00:21:29.433
God is a matter of faith.
Faith only guides you.

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:33.313
Let's say you don't
believe in God.

00:21:33.926 --> 00:21:35.206
You believe in people,
don't you?

00:21:36.253 --> 00:21:37.767
Think of the people
who voted for you.

00:21:39.366 --> 00:21:41.946
Without the slightest fear
of Pandiyaraj's money or power,

00:21:42.506 --> 00:21:43.566
they voted for you.

00:21:44.393 --> 00:21:45.440
Stand up for them.

00:21:45.846 --> 00:21:47.526
Keep fighting
for as long as you can.

00:21:52.913 --> 00:21:55.553
You've grown quite old.

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:57.860
You're talking
like a philosopher.

00:22:01.493 --> 00:22:02.533
I'm not old at all.

00:22:03.653 --> 00:22:05.733
I just used a little less
hair dye today, that's all.

00:22:26.973 --> 00:22:27.973
Hey!

00:22:28.393 --> 00:22:30.287
Isn't this enough to get
Pandiyaraj removed?

00:22:31.520 --> 00:22:33.120
No, it's not enough.
- Why?

00:22:33.660 --> 00:22:34.717
If we present this,

00:22:34.817 --> 00:22:36.266
they'll remove Pandiyaraj
for corruption

00:22:36.366 --> 00:22:37.841
and call for a re-election.

00:22:38.140 --> 00:22:39.473
Oh!
- Pandiyaraj

00:22:39.693 --> 00:22:41.833
might put forward
his own candidate.

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:44.608
But if we can prove
that more than 15 people

00:22:44.691 --> 00:22:45.891
accepted bribes and voted,

00:22:46.153 --> 00:22:47.633
we can definitely avoid
a re-election.

00:22:47.953 --> 00:22:49.580
Under the rules, Veni will win.

00:22:50.618 --> 00:22:51.618
Smart!

00:22:52.113 --> 00:22:53.933
It's a solid plan, but..

00:22:55.127 --> 00:22:56.853
where are we going
to find those 15 people?

00:22:57.853 --> 00:22:58.853
I'll tell you.

00:22:59.660 --> 00:23:00.940
We need to crack
this case today.

00:23:01.166 --> 00:23:02.366
We've got a lot of work to do.

00:23:03.794 --> 00:23:05.380
So, shall we head home?

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:09.360
Are you sure?

00:23:10.347 --> 00:23:11.347
Yeah.

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:12.801
Shall we go?

00:23:19.773 --> 00:23:20.773
Come in.

00:23:22.569 --> 00:23:23.569
Come in.

00:23:26.523 --> 00:23:27.643
Did you want to see me, sir?

00:23:28.756 --> 00:23:29.996
Ah, yes.

00:23:31.036 --> 00:23:32.036
Listen, Yazhini.

00:23:32.863 --> 00:23:35.270
Whatever the case,
you're Mr. Raj Sekar's daughter.

00:23:36.243 --> 00:23:37.896
Even though
he didn't support me,

00:23:38.836 --> 00:23:41.343
I won't do anything
against him or against you,

00:23:41.536 --> 00:23:42.930
for that matter.

00:23:43.510 --> 00:23:46.403
So, you can work with me
as my junior.

00:23:47.156 --> 00:23:49.643
Either way, that Deva fellow
will end up out on the street.

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:51.950
Why are you wasting your time
following him around?

00:23:53.769 --> 00:23:54.769
Why, sir?

00:23:55.996 --> 00:23:57.410
If I weren't
Raj Sekar's daughter,

00:23:58.296 --> 00:23:59.856
would you have
offered me this job, sir?

00:24:00.670 --> 00:24:01.670
Definitely not.

00:24:02.576 --> 00:24:03.576
But Deva

00:24:03.690 --> 00:24:05.850
stood by me
without knowing who I was.

00:24:07.110 --> 00:24:08.110
In fact,

00:24:08.430 --> 00:24:11.350
I had given Mr. Mohanakrishnan
a lead for a case.

00:24:12.123 --> 00:24:14.790
Because of that lead,
he lost an entire hearing, sir.

00:24:15.627 --> 00:24:17.027
If he were like you,

00:24:17.614 --> 00:24:19.334
he would have held
a grudge against me.

00:24:20.854 --> 00:24:22.414
But Deva isn't that kind of person.

00:24:23.347 --> 00:24:24.587
Even after losing that hearing,

00:24:25.073 --> 00:24:26.600
he wasn't the least
bit angry with me.

00:24:27.347 --> 00:24:29.954
He hired me purely
on the basis of my talent.

00:24:34.137 --> 00:24:35.937
I don't abandon people
who believe in me, sir.

00:24:37.777 --> 00:24:39.230
I'll always stand by Deva.

00:24:39.443 --> 00:24:40.803
You'll have to find someone else.

00:24:41.277 --> 00:24:43.610
Fine. Who can change what's
written in someone's fate?

00:24:43.823 --> 00:24:45.190
I've said all I have to say.

00:24:46.687 --> 00:24:47.687
Sir,

00:24:48.207 --> 00:24:50.127
even if we end up under a tree,
as you suggested,

00:24:50.880 --> 00:24:52.040
we won't stay there for long.

00:24:53.513 --> 00:24:56.007
One day, we'll make it
to the top, sir.

00:24:57.147 --> 00:24:58.500
You'll live to see it happen.

00:25:00.318 --> 00:25:01.318
Thank you, sir.

00:27:04.521 --> 00:27:05.634
'What's going on here?'

00:27:07.637 --> 00:27:10.231
'Why is Deva laughing and
chatting like this with Amreen?'

00:27:11.431 --> 00:27:13.224
'Let me call Yazhini.'

00:27:25.864 --> 00:27:27.571
Yes, Thivi.
- What is it, Yazhini?

00:27:27.804 --> 00:27:30.471
Did you stop working with Deva?
- Hey!

00:27:31.231 --> 00:27:32.831
No, nothing like that.
Who told you that?

00:27:33.378 --> 00:27:37.309
No, Deva and Amreen
are working together.

00:27:37.392 --> 00:27:38.392
That's why I asked.

00:27:39.583 --> 00:27:40.876
Working together?

00:27:41.570 --> 00:27:42.967
Has she come
all the way to his house?

00:27:43.050 --> 00:27:45.650
Yes, they're both giggling
and chatting away.

00:27:46.210 --> 00:27:47.950
Is he actually laughing?
- Yes, Yazhini.

00:27:50.202 --> 00:27:51.842
He wouldn't laugh
even if you paid him.

00:27:53.987 --> 00:27:56.393
Hello? Yazhini, are you there?
- I'm here. I'm here.

00:27:56.720 --> 00:27:58.564
You don't understand
how serious this is.

00:27:58.647 --> 00:28:01.127
I need to know what's going on
right now. Come home right away.

00:28:03.626 --> 00:28:04.980
I have other things to do.

00:28:05.900 --> 00:28:07.666
Are you coming or not?

00:28:09.247 --> 00:28:10.247
All right.

00:28:10.660 --> 00:28:11.660
I'm only coming

00:28:12.053 --> 00:28:13.273
because you asked me to.

00:28:13.693 --> 00:28:15.186
Right?
- Okay. Hurry up.

00:28:17.726 --> 00:28:18.884
Earlier, at the gelato shop..

00:28:18.967 --> 00:28:20.307
Is he laughing at home?

00:28:23.600 --> 00:28:25.120
Amreen, did you check?
- This is done.

00:28:26.523 --> 00:28:28.503
Not this one.
- Let me see who it is.

00:28:29.155 --> 00:28:30.902
No, wait. I'll check.

00:28:41.525 --> 00:28:43.232
Yazhini, what are
you doing here?

00:28:43.315 --> 00:28:44.675
Exactly.
What are you doing here?

00:28:47.104 --> 00:28:48.837
Deva, I need to speak with you.

00:28:49.744 --> 00:28:50.791
All right. Just a moment.

00:28:51.617 --> 00:28:52.617
Keep checking this.

00:28:57.862 --> 00:28:58.862
What's up, heroine?

00:29:02.093 --> 00:29:03.093
Come on.

00:29:06.853 --> 00:29:08.060
Tell me. What happened?

00:29:09.670 --> 00:29:11.837
Pandiyaraj called me
to meet him.

00:29:13.803 --> 00:29:15.076
Pandiyaraj? Why?

00:29:15.425 --> 00:29:18.332
He offered me a position
as his junior associate.

00:29:18.726 --> 00:29:19.726
What did you tell him?

00:29:20.919 --> 00:29:22.086
Don't annoy me.

00:29:23.206 --> 00:29:24.326
What else could I have said?

00:29:26.719 --> 00:29:27.946
I told him I'd stay with Deva

00:29:28.386 --> 00:29:30.386
and wouldn't join anyone else,
no matter who asked.

00:29:33.459 --> 00:29:34.459
All right. Come on.

00:29:34.544 --> 00:29:36.279
I'll help you, too.
We're running out of time.

00:29:36.319 --> 00:29:38.092
So, what about our case?

00:29:42.462 --> 00:29:44.042
Here's the answer
to your question.

00:29:48.912 --> 00:29:50.311
As soon as the loans
were disbursed,

00:29:50.394 --> 00:29:52.114
the money went into
the companies' accounts.

00:29:52.432 --> 00:29:53.832
Where did the money go next?

00:29:55.485 --> 00:29:56.538
Wellstone Trust.

00:29:57.596 --> 00:30:01.009
Deva, how could all the loans
from 50 different companies

00:30:01.198 --> 00:30:03.332
end up in a single trust?

00:30:04.038 --> 00:30:07.105
And all within 48 hours of
the loans being disbursed.

00:30:08.058 --> 00:30:09.258
Something's wrong here,
isn't it?

00:30:09.298 --> 00:30:10.349
Yes.

00:30:10.428 --> 00:30:12.012
Do we have any information
about that trust?

00:30:12.611 --> 00:30:13.756
I've already gathered
the information.

00:30:13.839 --> 00:30:15.972
Shall we visit
the trust tomorrow?

00:30:16.150 --> 00:30:17.150
No, Yazhini.

00:30:17.918 --> 00:30:21.478
If we go there, Karunakaran
and his client might be alerted.

00:30:24.031 --> 00:30:25.825
We don't even know
who's behind this.

00:30:26.611 --> 00:30:28.218
Then what should we do?

00:30:28.691 --> 00:30:30.851
If we bring this up
directly in court,

00:30:32.272 --> 00:30:33.772
they'll be caught off guard.

00:30:35.145 --> 00:30:37.225
They won't have time to destroy
the evidence, either.

00:30:38.872 --> 00:30:39.872
Exactly.

00:30:40.145 --> 00:30:41.305
All right. Let's get to work.

00:30:50.675 --> 00:30:52.801
That video was so funny.

00:30:56.773 --> 00:30:58.386
All right. Sit there.
I'll help you, too.

00:31:01.359 --> 00:31:02.992
Thivi, go inside.
- Okay.

00:31:03.579 --> 00:31:05.296
I'm going to bed.
Good night, guys.

00:31:05.379 --> 00:31:06.391
Have fun.
- Good night.

00:31:06.431 --> 00:31:07.650
Good night.
- Bye.

00:31:15.289 --> 00:31:16.596
Deva, look at this.

00:31:16.781 --> 00:31:18.907
These five people
enrolled just three days ago.

00:31:21.642 --> 00:31:24.135
Very good, Amreen.
That was quick. Great.

00:31:31.833 --> 00:31:32.833
Look at this.

00:31:49.087 --> 00:31:50.087
Yazhini.

00:32:23.630 --> 00:32:24.951
Deva, you're already up

00:32:25.034 --> 00:32:26.641
and sitting here
at 7:00 miraculously?

00:32:27.399 --> 00:32:28.606
I haven't slept all night.

00:32:29.499 --> 00:32:30.699
I've got a lot of work, Thivi.

00:32:31.204 --> 00:32:32.817
Oh, I thought so!

00:32:33.031 --> 00:32:35.671
I thought you'd finally
started listening to your alarm.

00:32:35.791 --> 00:32:37.571
Go get ready for school.
You're getting late.

00:32:37.611 --> 00:32:39.091
All right, Deva.

00:32:41.364 --> 00:32:42.364
Okay, girls.

00:32:42.807 --> 00:32:43.988
We've got everything we need.

00:32:44.071 --> 00:32:45.831
Freshen up and come along.
See you in court.

00:32:46.955 --> 00:32:47.955
Okay.

00:32:48.372 --> 00:32:49.638
Bye, Deva.
- Bye.

00:33:06.287 --> 00:33:07.219
Muthu!

00:33:10.160 --> 00:33:11.079
Muthu!

00:33:20.262 --> 00:33:21.742
'Starting this early
in the morning?'

00:33:29.515 --> 00:33:30.635
Muthu,

00:33:30.908 --> 00:33:32.168
what's your problem now?

00:33:32.835 --> 00:33:34.628
Why do you keep
walking away from me?

00:33:40.922 --> 00:33:42.369
At least you talk to him.

00:33:42.610 --> 00:33:43.542
Dude!

00:33:43.582 --> 00:33:46.515
No, senior.
She told me to tell you.

00:33:51.208 --> 00:33:52.335
Listen, Muthu.

00:33:53.262 --> 00:33:55.155
Please hear me out.

00:34:05.727 --> 00:34:06.603
Muthu..

00:34:07.385 --> 00:34:08.385
Listen to me.

00:34:08.705 --> 00:34:10.138
I understand.

00:34:10.438 --> 00:34:12.271
You brought it for me
with so much care,

00:34:12.452 --> 00:34:14.110
and my reaction
must have hurt you.

00:34:14.193 --> 00:34:15.900
Try to see things
from my perspective.

00:34:16.160 --> 00:34:17.720
I only said you should spend

00:34:17.806 --> 00:34:19.439
what you've earned
through hard work.

00:34:20.660 --> 00:34:23.627
I never said I didn't want
your care or affection, Muthu.

00:34:24.253 --> 00:34:25.880
Why can't you understand that?

00:34:35.368 --> 00:34:36.303
Muthu..

00:34:39.066 --> 00:34:40.133
Muthu, what's wrong?

00:34:49.326 --> 00:34:50.539
Hey! Muthu!

00:34:51.093 --> 00:34:52.134
'What's wrong?'
- 'What's wrong?'

00:34:52.217 --> 00:34:54.297
'Why is he walking away?'
- 'Why is he walking away?'

00:35:00.610 --> 00:35:02.130
'Headache on top of this.'

00:35:03.982 --> 00:35:05.443
When they're together,
they fight,

00:35:05.526 --> 00:35:07.446
but when they're apart,
they act all lovey-dovey.

00:35:07.543 --> 00:35:09.080
This is exactly why
I don't fall in love.

00:35:09.120 --> 00:35:10.560
I'll go straight
to marriage instead.

00:35:11.527 --> 00:35:13.161
Muthu has been suspended

00:35:13.244 --> 00:35:14.844
for three months
on disciplinary grounds.

00:35:15.187 --> 00:35:16.593
What? Why?

00:35:16.887 --> 00:35:18.593
For beating that man
in the corridor.

00:35:19.754 --> 00:35:20.754
What should we do now?

00:35:22.822 --> 00:35:23.942
We're going to see Ms. Veni.

00:35:24.666 --> 00:35:25.946
We'll explain everything to her.

00:35:39.066 --> 00:35:40.066
Hi, senior.

00:35:45.116 --> 00:35:46.116
What happened?

00:35:50.750 --> 00:35:51.750
Here.

00:35:54.346 --> 00:35:55.346
On disciplinary grounds,

00:35:55.653 --> 00:35:57.959
they've suspended me
for three months.

00:36:01.576 --> 00:36:02.576
Suspended?

00:36:04.305 --> 00:36:05.585
This must be Pandiyaraj's doing.

00:36:06.178 --> 00:36:07.232
Now that he's president,

00:36:07.869 --> 00:36:08.869
he's taking revenge.

00:36:12.129 --> 00:36:14.302
Yazhini, please don't take this
the wrong way,

00:36:15.150 --> 00:36:16.590
but I want to be alone for a while.

00:36:18.057 --> 00:36:19.057
I hope you understand.

00:36:22.797 --> 00:36:24.224
I'm sorry.
- Thank you.

00:36:35.749 --> 00:36:37.123
Your problem is with me,
isn't it?

00:36:37.363 --> 00:36:40.109
Don't ruin a promising
young lawyer's future.

00:36:41.527 --> 00:36:43.520
Do you think I had
something to do with this?

00:36:45.420 --> 00:36:46.967
Who else could it be?

00:36:48.180 --> 00:36:49.320
There's no need to doubt it.

00:36:50.027 --> 00:36:51.307
I did this.

00:36:51.893 --> 00:36:53.253
He crossed the line.

00:36:53.980 --> 00:36:55.460
Ask Keerthana if you
don't believe me.

00:36:59.919 --> 00:37:00.919
Sir..

00:37:01.686 --> 00:37:02.919
He's still a young man.

00:37:03.379 --> 00:37:04.879
He has a bright future
ahead of him.

00:37:06.526 --> 00:37:08.186
Please, sir. Don't do this.

00:37:12.541 --> 00:37:14.728
Come on, Veni.
If this upsets you so much,

00:37:15.028 --> 00:37:16.301
there's much worse to come.

00:37:17.081 --> 00:37:19.588
I'll cut off your support
at the roots.

00:37:20.334 --> 00:37:22.581
And Sathyan is next.

00:37:22.928 --> 00:37:25.268
So do whatever you can.

00:37:28.874 --> 00:37:30.674
If this matters so much to you,

00:37:31.068 --> 00:37:32.988
apologise and admit that
what you did was wrong.

00:37:33.595 --> 00:37:35.141
Think about it.
- Ma'am..

00:37:36.221 --> 00:37:37.734
You don't need to apologise
to anyone.

00:37:38.056 --> 00:37:39.056
Sir..

00:37:39.081 --> 00:37:40.775
Nothing you say
is going to happen,

00:37:40.900 --> 00:37:42.180
nor will any apology be offered.

00:37:44.934 --> 00:37:46.108
Both of you, get out.

00:37:46.900 --> 00:37:47.900
Ma'am..

00:37:48.294 --> 00:37:49.368
Get out.

00:37:54.762 --> 00:37:55.762
Sit down.

00:38:10.008 --> 00:38:11.008
Here.

00:38:16.415 --> 00:38:17.435
Are you messing with me?

00:38:17.518 --> 00:38:19.181
How long am I supposed
to manage on my own?

00:38:19.221 --> 00:38:21.348
Sudalai, wait a moment.
- Did you get it or not?

00:38:22.795 --> 00:38:24.668
We got it. That man is done for!

00:38:25.108 --> 00:38:27.932
Let's see who can stop Ms. Veni
from becoming president.

00:38:28.015 --> 00:38:29.015
Sudalai,

00:38:29.181 --> 00:38:30.968
go gather the crowd.

00:38:32.328 --> 00:38:34.405
We'll gather them. First, let me
call that man and inform him.

00:38:34.488 --> 00:38:36.995
Hurry up. We don't have time.
Let's go.

00:38:43.530 --> 00:38:44.410
Hello.
- Mate.

00:38:44.513 --> 00:38:46.158
Sir..
- I've sought you for two days.

00:38:46.241 --> 00:38:47.256
You haven't been coming to
the canteen. Where have you..

00:38:47.339 --> 00:38:48.495
Sathyan, just hear me out.

00:38:48.578 --> 00:38:50.598
Just listen to me.
- Wait until I get there.

00:38:50.681 --> 00:38:52.498
You want another ₹2,000
on top of this?

00:38:52.581 --> 00:38:53.581
For the work you do.

00:38:54.015 --> 00:38:55.222
Are you going to listen
to me or not?

00:38:55.262 --> 00:38:57.248
What do you have to say?
Go on. Tell me.

00:39:06.995 --> 00:39:08.921
Don't worry. I'll handle it.
- All right.

00:39:14.984 --> 00:39:16.931
Here.
What are you thinking about?

00:39:21.529 --> 00:39:23.416
Write and sign a statement

00:39:24.309 --> 00:39:25.629
promising never to contest
another election.

00:39:26.136 --> 00:39:27.589
I'll do whatever you ask.

00:39:31.096 --> 00:39:32.096
Do it.

00:39:57.490 --> 00:39:58.490
What is it, Deva?

00:39:58.757 --> 00:40:00.570
Did you get scared
when I spoke to Yazhini?

00:40:00.997 --> 00:40:02.070
If you like,

00:40:02.390 --> 00:40:04.703
you can write an apology letter,
just like Veni.

00:40:15.259 --> 00:40:16.699
How about that? Scared?

00:40:18.179 --> 00:40:19.179
Me?

00:40:21.252 --> 00:40:22.740
Actually,
when you first threatened

00:40:22.823 --> 00:40:24.136
to throw me
out of your chambers,

00:40:24.652 --> 00:40:26.446
I was a little scared.
Just a tiny bit.

00:40:26.839 --> 00:40:28.246
You should've stopped there.

00:40:29.499 --> 00:40:30.800
You shouldn't intimidate
someone so much

00:40:30.883 --> 00:40:32.243
that they stop
being afraid of you.

00:40:32.466 --> 00:40:35.012
Deva, you're going too far.

00:40:35.826 --> 00:40:38.659
You're talking to the President
of the Bar Association.

00:40:39.332 --> 00:40:41.959
Don't forget that.
- That's exactly my point, sir.

00:40:43.946 --> 00:40:45.501
I wonder if you'll still be

00:40:45.584 --> 00:40:47.699
the Bar Association President
much longer.

00:40:51.225 --> 00:40:52.425
What nonsense are you spewing?

00:40:53.287 --> 00:40:54.873
I'm not talking nonsense, sir.
Yazhini..

00:40:58.218 --> 00:41:00.381
The voters' list you hurried
to fill with new members

00:41:00.464 --> 00:41:02.331
just three days
before the election..

00:41:02.891 --> 00:41:04.171
Here's the list
of those members.

00:41:09.551 --> 00:41:12.098
Enrolling people
on the voters' list isn't a crime.

00:41:12.225 --> 00:41:13.225
That's not a crime.

00:41:13.831 --> 00:41:15.191
But giving bribes

00:41:15.298 --> 00:41:17.665
and making everyone
swear to vote for you..

00:41:18.745 --> 00:41:19.745
That's a crime.

00:41:19.998 --> 00:41:22.011
I didn't bribe anyone.

00:41:30.796 --> 00:41:31.796
Don't, Deva.

00:41:32.423 --> 00:41:33.423
Let it go.

00:41:34.543 --> 00:41:36.507
I'll revoke Muthu's suspension.

00:41:36.590 --> 00:41:39.110
Hey, do you think I did all this
just because of the suspension?

00:41:39.316 --> 00:41:40.963
You shouldn't even be
in this court.

00:41:42.596 --> 00:41:44.490
Before you threaten
someone again,

00:41:44.670 --> 00:41:47.350
remember the faces of everyone
standing here.

00:41:52.096 --> 00:41:54.076
Please don't do this, Deva.

00:41:54.603 --> 00:41:55.603
Oh, dear!

00:41:56.123 --> 00:41:57.664
Even if you submit
an apology letter,

00:41:57.747 --> 00:41:58.887
you'll still be suspended.

00:42:03.710 --> 00:42:05.070
I'll go and speak
to the committee.

00:42:05.263 --> 00:42:06.743
You must be there
within ten minutes.

00:42:07.303 --> 00:42:08.303
Understood?

00:42:08.916 --> 00:42:09.916
All right?

00:42:13.797 --> 00:42:16.110
Ma'am, if you sign anything
from now on,

00:42:16.510 --> 00:42:18.590
it should be as the President
of the Bar Association.

00:42:19.263 --> 00:42:20.263
Yes, ma'am.

00:42:20.610 --> 00:42:22.117
Go and freshen up.

00:42:22.337 --> 00:42:24.057
You don't need to sit
in this chair anymore.

00:42:27.177 --> 00:42:28.237
Come on, ma'am. Let's go.

00:42:42.760 --> 00:42:44.238
Down with Pandiyaraj!

00:42:44.321 --> 00:42:46.228
Down with Pandiyaraj!

00:42:46.328 --> 00:42:48.963
Down with Pandiyaraj!

00:42:49.046 --> 00:42:52.195
Down with Pandiyaraj!

00:42:52.288 --> 00:42:54.088
Down with Pandiyaraj!

00:43:03.210 --> 00:43:05.307
Do you want to see
how much support you have here?

00:43:05.390 --> 00:43:06.390
Come with me.

00:43:10.895 --> 00:43:12.179
Justice for Veni!

00:43:12.262 --> 00:43:13.611
Justice for Veni!

00:43:13.694 --> 00:43:15.197
Justice for Veni!

00:43:15.280 --> 00:43:17.008
Justice for Veni!

00:43:17.091 --> 00:43:19.591
Justice for Veni!

00:43:19.674 --> 00:43:21.174
Justice for Veni!

00:43:21.369 --> 00:43:23.049
Justice for Veni!
- What is it?

00:43:23.209 --> 00:43:24.432
Justice for Veni!

00:43:24.515 --> 00:43:26.916
Justice for Veni!

00:43:26.999 --> 00:43:28.459
Justice for Veni!

00:43:28.869 --> 00:43:31.555
Justice for Veni!

00:43:31.655 --> 00:43:33.285
Justice for Veni!

00:43:33.368 --> 00:43:34.782
Justice for Veni!

00:43:34.865 --> 00:43:36.391
Justice for Veni!

00:43:40.882 --> 00:43:43.162
Mr. Pandiyaraj,
how do you explain all this?

00:43:43.787 --> 00:43:44.787
Sir..

00:43:44.920 --> 00:43:47.075
They're trying to make
false accusations against me.

00:43:47.158 --> 00:43:49.438
This boy's confession
makes it crystal clear.

00:43:49.537 --> 00:43:50.537
That's not all.

00:43:50.744 --> 00:43:54.336
You enrolled 100 people just
three days before the election.

00:43:54.471 --> 00:43:55.713
Upon verification,

00:43:55.796 --> 00:43:58.121
all 100 of them were found
to have voted for you.

00:43:58.225 --> 00:44:00.432
Sir, he's the one
questioning that boy, isn't he?

00:44:00.825 --> 00:44:02.518
The boy could be
a planted witness.

00:44:02.752 --> 00:44:05.932
Sir, do they have any proof
that I paid anyone?

00:44:07.005 --> 00:44:09.045
Since you've asked, sir,
we have proof of that, too.

00:44:15.929 --> 00:44:17.849
Sasi is your junior, isn't he?

00:44:18.495 --> 00:44:19.655
What are you going to do now?

00:44:23.035 --> 00:44:24.374
Sasi.
- Sir?

00:44:24.474 --> 00:44:25.731
Turn yourself in.

00:44:25.962 --> 00:44:27.048
I'll take care of the rest.

00:44:27.169 --> 00:44:28.785
What are you two
whispering about?

00:44:28.885 --> 00:44:30.100
Sir..

00:44:30.200 --> 00:44:31.200
It's nothing, sir.

00:44:31.243 --> 00:44:32.356
I was asking why
he's doing all this

00:44:32.439 --> 00:44:33.651
without my knowledge.

00:44:33.734 --> 00:44:35.882
I have absolutely
nothing to do with this, sir.

00:44:36.395 --> 00:44:38.142
Sir, he's lying!

00:44:39.469 --> 00:44:41.702
I distributed the entire amount
on his instructions.

00:44:41.875 --> 00:44:43.749
I have all the proof with me, sir.

00:44:44.122 --> 00:44:46.119
He's even asking me
to turn myself in, sir.

00:44:46.202 --> 00:44:47.935
Mr. Pandiyaraj,
what do you think this is?

00:44:48.055 --> 00:44:50.215
Do you think we have
nothing better to do?

00:44:52.570 --> 00:44:53.452
Look here.

00:44:53.535 --> 00:44:55.742
We have very clear evidence.
He's the one behind it.

00:45:01.877 --> 00:45:03.637
Justice for Veni!

00:45:03.757 --> 00:45:05.197
Justice for Veni!

00:45:05.330 --> 00:45:07.890
Justice for Veni!

00:45:08.090 --> 00:45:09.357
Justice for Veni!
- Quiet, please!

00:45:09.397 --> 00:45:11.551
Everyone, maintain silence.
Please listen to me.

00:45:11.718 --> 00:45:13.198
Please remain quiet.

00:45:13.870 --> 00:45:16.604
In this election,
the elected president,

00:45:17.350 --> 00:45:19.274
Mr. Pandiyaraj has been proven

00:45:19.357 --> 00:45:21.184
to have committed
electoral fraud.

00:45:21.284 --> 00:45:23.050
Therefore, our committee
has decided to ask

00:45:23.177 --> 00:45:24.624
the Election Commission

00:45:24.744 --> 00:45:27.998
to immediately revoke
his presidency.

00:45:28.784 --> 00:45:31.747
Meanwhile, the majority
of votes in the election

00:45:31.830 --> 00:45:33.504
went to Ms. Veni.

00:45:34.604 --> 00:45:37.864
Therefore, the new President
of your association

00:45:38.382 --> 00:45:40.055
is Ms. Veni Chandrakanth.

00:47:30.883 --> 00:47:31.883
Just a moment.

00:47:36.321 --> 00:47:38.214
It takes very little

00:47:38.374 --> 00:47:39.934
for everything here
to turn upside down.

00:47:41.334 --> 00:47:43.128
If you let power
make you arrogant,

00:47:43.494 --> 00:47:44.788
this is what happens.

00:48:25.513 --> 00:48:27.473
'Pandiyaraj's nameplate,
I have a place for that.'

00:48:58.609 --> 00:48:59.609
Thanks, Deva.

00:49:02.649 --> 00:49:03.769
There's no need to thank me.

00:49:05.149 --> 00:49:07.622
You promised Yazhini

00:49:07.849 --> 00:49:09.676
that my chambers would be safe

00:49:09.769 --> 00:49:11.456
once you became president.

00:49:11.822 --> 00:49:13.516
I trust you'll keep
your promise.

00:49:14.062 --> 00:49:16.442
Once I make a promise,
I never break it.

00:49:18.624 --> 00:49:19.624
Then, okay.

00:51:20.323 --> 00:51:23.893
At long last,
Pandiyaraj's issue is resolved.

00:51:26.432 --> 00:51:27.448
It feels so peaceful.

00:51:31.635 --> 00:51:33.435
We saved the chamber,
but what about the case?

00:51:33.651 --> 00:51:35.135
We must save that somehow too.

00:51:35.744 --> 00:51:36.620
Tomorrow is the hearing.

00:51:36.660 --> 00:51:38.713
Did you get any details
about that Wellstone Trust?

00:51:39.299 --> 00:51:41.932
Yes. They are a reputed NGO.

00:51:42.190 --> 00:51:44.095
They have been carrying out
a lot of charity projects.

00:51:44.135 --> 00:51:46.463
I checked their profile.
Everything looks clean.

00:51:47.041 --> 00:51:48.178
If it looks too clean,

00:51:48.306 --> 00:51:50.448
it means the dirt is hidden
somewhere else.

00:51:50.948 --> 00:51:52.373
No matter how I look at it,

00:51:52.397 --> 00:51:53.877
I cannot accept this
as a coincidence.

00:51:55.073 --> 00:51:56.518
Yes, I feel the same way too.

00:51:56.768 --> 00:51:58.471
But I am not sure
if what we have

00:51:59.401 --> 00:52:01.010
will be enough
for tomorrow's hearing.

00:52:01.869 --> 00:52:04.619
The money from shell companies
has gone only to this trust.

00:52:06.198 --> 00:52:08.278
That too within 48 hours
of being deposited.

00:52:08.659 --> 00:52:09.939
Tomorrow is just
the first trial.

00:52:10.088 --> 00:52:12.463
Our job is to create
reasonable doubt.

00:52:12.744 --> 00:52:14.084
Just like Karunakaran did

00:52:14.108 --> 00:52:15.674
against the bank
in the last hearing.

00:52:17.682 --> 00:52:21.276
So, we must use
his own strategy against him,

00:52:21.315 --> 00:52:22.338
right?
- Correct.

00:52:22.682 --> 00:52:24.854
For that, we need
strong argument points.

00:52:25.799 --> 00:52:27.893
Right, I shall start
preparing them.

00:52:28.409 --> 00:52:29.807
That alone will not do, Yazhini.

00:52:29.916 --> 00:52:31.623
Before heading
to court tomorrow,

00:52:31.647 --> 00:52:33.041
we will do a mock trial.

00:52:35.337 --> 00:52:36.477
No matter what angle
the questions come from,

00:52:36.517 --> 00:52:37.517
we must be ready.

00:52:38.815 --> 00:52:40.024
Karunakaran is extremely sharp.

00:52:40.048 --> 00:52:41.658
He will try to pick holes
in our argument.

00:52:41.682 --> 00:52:43.541
But we must not give him
that chance.

00:52:45.104 --> 00:52:46.104
Understood.

00:52:46.479 --> 00:52:47.916
Good. Start prepping.

00:52:55.612 --> 00:52:57.315
'You have won a single case,'

00:52:57.431 --> 00:52:59.421
'that too with a lawyer
whose name is barely known.'

00:52:59.445 --> 00:53:01.134
'Do you know who
the opposition lawyer'

00:53:01.158 --> 00:53:02.846
'was in the case
your sister settled?'

00:53:03.018 --> 00:53:04.004
'Karunakaran!'

00:53:04.028 --> 00:53:07.743
'The value of the case
she settled was ₹100 crore!'

00:53:07.843 --> 00:53:09.937
'Because of that,
the profit to our firm alone'

00:53:09.962 --> 00:53:11.377
'was ₹15 crore!'

00:53:11.862 --> 00:53:14.098
'After concluding
such a massive case,'

00:53:14.198 --> 00:53:15.941
'she remains so quiet.'

00:53:16.041 --> 00:53:18.494
'Having won just one case,
look at the way you brag!'

00:53:26.838 --> 00:53:30.815
♪ Floating down
The Thamirabarani River ♪

00:53:31.104 --> 00:53:35.291
♪ My beautiful flower ♪

00:53:40.704 --> 00:53:42.650
You should have seen her today,

00:53:43.908 --> 00:53:46.893
sitting with her legs crossed!
- Who?

00:53:48.190 --> 00:53:49.190
Look here!

00:53:49.573 --> 00:53:51.346
I still get goosebumps!

00:53:51.455 --> 00:53:53.643
All right, Dad. Calm down.

00:53:54.143 --> 00:53:55.143
Get lost!

00:53:56.502 --> 00:53:58.158
If he does not drink to it,
who will?

00:53:58.183 --> 00:53:59.150
Exactly!

00:53:59.190 --> 00:54:02.401
When he and she were standing
in that corridor..

00:54:02.940 --> 00:54:04.978
What was that film we watched?
- "Mouna Raagam"?

00:54:06.221 --> 00:54:08.416
Karthik, Revathi!

00:54:09.362 --> 00:54:12.697
It was just like
Karthik and Revathi!

00:54:12.760 --> 00:54:13.845
Is that so?
- When was this?

00:54:13.885 --> 00:54:17.455
Between them losing and

00:54:17.784 --> 00:54:20.323
becoming the president!
- Not bad at all, Dad!

00:54:20.948 --> 00:54:22.431
You are scoring
right in the gap!

00:54:23.073 --> 00:54:24.271
Son, in the market,
if you are not alert,

00:54:24.311 --> 00:54:25.665
they'll rob you blind.

00:54:25.689 --> 00:54:27.830
Market, alert.. Dad,
what on earth are you saying?

00:54:28.034 --> 00:54:30.268
When you reach my age,
you'll understand.

00:54:30.963 --> 00:54:33.041
Today I am extremely..

00:54:34.909 --> 00:54:36.892
That's what I'm saying.
You are going a bit overboard.

00:54:36.916 --> 00:54:37.916
Get lost!

00:54:38.541 --> 00:54:39.869
Veni has won!

00:54:40.556 --> 00:54:43.392
Dad, do you really like
Ms. Veni that much?

00:54:43.417 --> 00:54:44.846
What a fine family!

00:54:46.842 --> 00:54:47.876
My son is asking me!

00:54:47.961 --> 00:54:49.865
Yes, go on, tell him.
From the start!

00:54:52.080 --> 00:54:53.885
I have never seen you
this happy before, Dad.

00:54:54.830 --> 00:54:56.853
When Veni first came to me
to join as a junior,

00:54:56.877 --> 00:54:58.728
you should have seen her!
She was magnificent!

00:54:59.736 --> 00:55:01.436
Back then,
she had a terrible temper!

00:55:01.460 --> 00:55:03.300
As if she doesn't now!
- As if she doesn't now!

00:55:04.362 --> 00:55:05.362
Even now.

00:55:06.932 --> 00:55:09.424
The day I first saw her,
the interview was not for her..

00:55:10.674 --> 00:55:11.869
It was for Sathyan!

00:55:13.291 --> 00:55:14.565
Love at first sight!

00:55:16.315 --> 00:55:17.835
Yet you never let
your talent flourish.

00:55:18.127 --> 00:55:19.666
It flourished, my boy!

00:55:19.885 --> 00:55:22.664
Talent, love, Sathyan!

00:55:22.689 --> 00:55:24.369
A bit of booze,
a bit of snacks..

00:55:24.394 --> 00:55:25.698
Just like that!
- Exactly!

00:55:25.931 --> 00:55:27.901
They won't let
the day dawn today.

00:55:27.926 --> 00:55:29.046
Let me tell the whole story.

00:55:29.463 --> 00:55:31.023
If anyone interrupts,
I will thrash you!

00:55:32.518 --> 00:55:34.416
Without even caring
that I was a senior,

00:55:35.096 --> 00:55:37.284
she would
fiercely argue with me.

00:55:37.979 --> 00:55:41.002
Such arrogance!
She would never concede!

00:55:41.104 --> 00:55:42.464
And that is precisely
what I loved!

00:55:44.760 --> 00:55:45.869
Sudalai..

00:55:46.307 --> 00:55:47.400
How do you manage to react
as if hearing it

00:55:47.440 --> 00:55:48.892
for the first time
every single time?

00:55:48.916 --> 00:55:50.737
You get certain things

00:55:50.823 --> 00:55:52.580
only if you listen
to certain things.

00:55:53.065 --> 00:55:54.197
Yes.
- Right.

00:55:56.026 --> 00:55:57.901
Neither of us
confessed anything.

00:55:58.315 --> 00:56:00.034
Then one day,
she came and told me..

00:56:02.791 --> 00:56:04.698
What sort of intoxication
is this?

00:56:05.838 --> 00:56:07.815
The words she spoke that day..

00:56:08.737 --> 00:56:09.815
That was intoxication!

00:56:10.573 --> 00:56:12.096
What happened then?
- Why did it end?

00:56:12.994 --> 00:56:13.994
Because of me.

00:56:14.471 --> 00:56:15.939
I knew it!
- Because of this Sathyan.

00:56:15.964 --> 00:56:16.964
Just as I thought.

00:56:17.494 --> 00:56:19.877
We dreamt endless dreams
about our life.

00:56:19.902 --> 00:56:21.132
Yes, only dreams remain.

00:56:21.157 --> 00:56:23.617
We wished to be happy
for our entire lifetime.

00:56:23.987 --> 00:56:25.471
But this wretched life..

00:56:26.948 --> 00:56:28.369
Who has it ever left in peace?

00:56:28.916 --> 00:56:30.066
Certainly not me.
- No one at all.

00:56:30.090 --> 00:56:32.674
It ruins the peace of those
who are peaceful.

00:56:32.799 --> 00:56:34.357
It gives peace to the restless.

00:56:34.381 --> 00:56:35.939
It makes those
who wish to die live,

00:56:35.964 --> 00:56:37.687
and kills those
who wish to live.

00:56:37.712 --> 00:56:38.712
Correct.

00:56:39.338 --> 00:56:40.338
Poetry!

00:56:41.127 --> 00:56:42.455
Is this poetry, you fool?

00:56:43.041 --> 00:56:44.561
I felt like saying something,
so I did.

00:56:44.659 --> 00:56:46.337
No drinking until
I finish speaking!

00:56:47.014 --> 00:56:48.179
'As if we drank!'

00:56:49.135 --> 00:56:51.471
In the blink of an eye,

00:56:52.526 --> 00:56:53.526
twenty years!

00:56:54.744 --> 00:56:55.744
Gone!

00:56:57.955 --> 00:57:00.689
Canteen, samosas, puffs..

00:57:00.994 --> 00:57:02.557
I just rushed through it all.

00:57:03.143 --> 00:57:04.143
But she..

00:57:05.744 --> 00:57:08.151
She remained
right where she began.

00:57:08.197 --> 00:57:10.619
'That is what happens
when they hang out with you.'

00:57:12.252 --> 00:57:13.252
Veni..

00:57:14.182 --> 00:57:16.463
She longed to win big
as a lawyer.

00:57:17.502 --> 00:57:19.103
After so many years,
only today..

00:57:19.409 --> 00:57:21.541
She got everything, dear.

00:57:22.323 --> 00:57:23.323
That is the point.

00:57:24.080 --> 00:57:25.386
In the crucial moments
of her life,

00:57:25.486 --> 00:57:26.560
I was never by her side.

00:57:26.660 --> 00:57:27.981
'You wouldn't even stay
in the canteen!'

00:57:28.005 --> 00:57:30.176
That is why, no matter
what happens hereafter,

00:57:31.129 --> 00:57:32.216
I'll be by her side.
I've decided.

00:57:32.240 --> 00:57:33.404
She has won.
- Super, Dad.

00:57:34.004 --> 00:57:35.004
I will look after it.

00:57:36.504 --> 00:57:37.504
'He drank it.'

00:57:39.645 --> 00:57:41.090
Tell me, Kavin,

00:57:41.613 --> 00:57:44.442
your dad babbles
about everything to you,

00:57:44.467 --> 00:57:47.148
yet why won't he tell you
why they parted?

00:57:47.172 --> 00:57:48.172
I don't know that either.

00:57:48.772 --> 00:57:50.069
I don't know that either.

00:57:50.459 --> 00:57:51.944
At least tell the truth now.

00:57:52.600 --> 00:57:54.120
He's about to tell!
He's about to tell!

00:57:54.366 --> 00:57:56.920
Son, you are too young.
I cannot tell you.

00:57:56.945 --> 00:57:59.025
Shall I tell him then?
- Never mind him, you tell me.

00:57:59.069 --> 00:58:00.514
If you tell..

00:58:01.780 --> 00:58:04.226
I will kill you!
If you tell, I will kill you!

00:58:04.251 --> 00:58:06.011
'He won't let the one
who knows tell either!'

00:58:07.726 --> 00:58:09.484
Hey, Pandiyaraj!

00:58:09.820 --> 00:58:12.289
'The boss's buzz
has completely worn off.'

00:58:12.314 --> 00:58:15.063
Sitting like a stale samosa
from my canteen..

00:58:15.088 --> 00:58:16.632
Are only the samosas stale?

00:58:16.750 --> 00:58:18.679
Are you competing
against Veni herself?

00:58:19.859 --> 00:58:22.171
Disgusting! Shameless fellow!

00:58:22.461 --> 00:58:25.117
Did he spit snacks?
- Sorry, I spat.

00:58:26.414 --> 00:58:29.273
Even that is fine,
but he dares to threaten my son?

00:58:31.102 --> 00:58:33.414
He asks if your son
will clear law school!

00:58:33.439 --> 00:58:34.990
If Sathyan's son
doesn't pass law,

00:58:35.090 --> 00:58:36.105
what else will he pass?

00:58:36.204 --> 00:58:37.707
He will pass urine!

00:58:38.430 --> 00:58:40.375
My boy!
- Yes, your son!

00:58:41.234 --> 00:58:41.984
He won't tell.

00:58:42.008 --> 00:58:44.688
'Having bought it, he won't even
let us drink in peace!'

00:58:45.926 --> 00:58:46.926
Move aside!

00:58:47.006 --> 00:58:48.214
'Looks like it is about to tip.'

00:58:50.674 --> 00:58:51.674
It has tipped.

00:58:52.973 --> 00:58:55.093
The cart has tipped over.
Now we can drink peacefully.

00:59:01.817 --> 00:59:02.817
Meera..

00:59:03.559 --> 00:59:05.200
I feel so very happy today.

00:59:05.864 --> 00:59:06.864
Do you know why?

00:59:08.325 --> 00:59:09.536
Ms. Veni won today.

00:59:11.879 --> 00:59:12.879
Actually..

00:59:13.379 --> 00:59:17.277
Her victory has given me
immense courage, personally.

00:59:21.223 --> 00:59:22.223
By the way..

00:59:24.926 --> 00:59:26.801
Dad and you
had a love marriage, right?

00:59:28.403 --> 00:59:29.504
What does that feel like?

00:59:32.997 --> 00:59:34.325
If you ask why I am asking..

00:59:37.122 --> 00:59:38.200
I told you about

00:59:39.012 --> 00:59:40.192
Deva at my office, right?

00:59:41.942 --> 00:59:43.036
He..

00:59:44.504 --> 00:59:47.887
When he is the boss,
he is one way.

00:59:48.551 --> 00:59:52.075
Yet when he is with Thivi,
the way he cares for her,

00:59:52.770 --> 00:59:54.184
and the way he supports me,

00:59:55.169 --> 00:59:56.489
looking at all of this..

00:59:57.723 --> 01:00:01.129
I think I have begun
to like him a little too.

01:00:02.598 --> 01:00:03.598
But there is one thing.

01:00:04.340 --> 01:00:07.864
When he speaks to other girls,
I feel quite angry too.

01:00:09.301 --> 01:00:11.567
Mom, I don't even know
what sort of feeling this is.

01:00:11.786 --> 01:00:13.226
I just felt like
sharing it with you.

01:00:16.629 --> 01:00:19.176
Right. Tomorrow is
the Karunakaran case.

01:00:19.270 --> 01:00:20.794
I must win by all means.

01:00:21.637 --> 01:00:24.051
Be with me tomorrow, Mom.
Bye.

01:00:29.949 --> 01:00:32.598
When did you arrive?
- Don't worry. I just came in.

01:00:33.122 --> 01:00:34.700
By the way,
who are you saying bye to?

01:00:36.661 --> 01:00:37.661
To my mom.

01:00:42.770 --> 01:00:43.770
She is my mom.

01:00:46.833 --> 01:00:49.411
But she is no longer around.

01:00:51.426 --> 01:00:53.153
I am so sorry.
- It's all right.

01:00:57.044 --> 01:00:59.653
Tell me, I have stayed
with you all these days,

01:01:00.169 --> 01:01:03.151
yet I have never heard you speak
about your parents even once.

01:01:03.176 --> 01:01:04.176
Why?

01:01:08.692 --> 01:01:11.598
They won't speak to me.
- What happened?

01:01:13.020 --> 01:01:14.715
They are furious with me.

01:01:16.004 --> 01:01:17.067
Justified anger, really.

01:01:17.762 --> 01:01:20.950
For them to be that angry,
what did you do?

01:01:21.840 --> 01:01:23.063
Well, as the saying goes,

01:01:23.163 --> 01:01:24.782
love makes you do
strange things.

01:01:25.544 --> 01:01:26.583
I loved a boy.

01:01:27.770 --> 01:01:29.399
Believing he was my whole life,

01:01:29.423 --> 01:01:31.598
I fought with my family
and eloped,

01:01:32.325 --> 01:01:33.395
from Ooty to Chennai.

01:01:34.395 --> 01:01:36.012
What an utter fool I was,

01:01:36.817 --> 01:01:38.708
trusting a guy I had known
for four years,

01:01:39.286 --> 01:01:42.778
and walking out on parents
who raised me for 19 years!

01:01:43.669 --> 01:01:44.669
I am such an idiot!

01:01:46.645 --> 01:01:48.317
And then? What happened next?

01:01:48.520 --> 01:01:51.489
The usual story.
He turned out to be toxic,

01:01:52.098 --> 01:01:53.098
abusive.

01:01:53.820 --> 01:01:57.359
Just to walk out of that
relationship took me two years.

01:02:00.281 --> 01:02:02.484
Did you never go back home
after that?

01:02:02.509 --> 01:02:03.601
I tried.

01:02:06.000 --> 01:02:08.390
My parents wouldn't accept me.

01:02:09.609 --> 01:02:12.672
Dad told me never to come
anywhere near the house.

01:02:14.945 --> 01:02:15.945
Actually..

01:02:17.039 --> 01:02:18.101
Do you know something?

01:02:18.656 --> 01:02:20.156
Time is an amazing healer.

01:02:20.836 --> 01:02:22.484
Even after my mom passed away,

01:02:23.617 --> 01:02:25.133
I felt I couldn't handle
anything.

01:02:26.226 --> 01:02:27.844
I thought
I couldn't even survive.

01:02:29.242 --> 01:02:30.242
Yet look at us now.

01:02:31.125 --> 01:02:34.133
Somehow or other,
we keep going about our work.

01:02:35.679 --> 01:02:36.844
Time changes everything.

01:02:37.476 --> 01:02:40.586
Surely, one day, your parents'
anger towards you will subside.

01:02:41.875 --> 01:02:42.875
I hope so.

01:02:46.390 --> 01:02:47.390
Anyway..

01:02:47.867 --> 01:02:50.382
Are you jealous
that I am talking to your boss?

01:02:51.789 --> 01:02:53.086
Jealous?

01:02:54.445 --> 01:02:56.835
Not at all!
Why on earth would I be jealous?

01:02:57.164 --> 01:02:58.601
Wait, why did you ask?

01:02:59.398 --> 01:03:00.129
Nothing, really.

01:03:00.169 --> 01:03:01.601
Please tell me. Why did you ask?

01:03:01.626 --> 01:03:02.626
No, it's nothing!

01:03:04.242 --> 01:03:05.242
All right.

01:03:06.375 --> 01:03:07.375
Then..

01:03:07.906 --> 01:03:09.506
Did you come in
to ask me something?

01:03:09.569 --> 01:03:11.654
Oh shit, I completely forgot!

01:03:11.756 --> 01:03:12.781
I am making biryani.

01:03:13.390 --> 01:03:15.133
Do you want some?
- Yes!

01:03:16.383 --> 01:03:19.140
People who say they dislike
biryani aren't human at all!

01:03:21.320 --> 01:03:22.914
Shall we cook it together?

01:03:23.273 --> 01:03:25.375
All right, come, give me a hand.
- Sure!

01:03:40.123 --> 01:03:41.123
Madhi?

01:03:44.271 --> 01:03:45.896
One second. Madhi!

01:03:46.396 --> 01:03:47.396
Madhi!

01:03:47.857 --> 01:03:50.896
Hey, when did you return?
You said you'd take a long time!

01:03:51.904 --> 01:03:52.904
Madhi!

01:03:54.623 --> 01:03:56.224
Why haven't you called me once?

01:03:56.576 --> 01:03:58.087
Look how many messages
I sent you!

01:03:58.111 --> 01:03:59.998
Did you reply
to even a single one?

01:04:00.201 --> 01:04:01.201
Madhi! Madhi..

01:04:02.638 --> 01:04:05.693
I keep talking, and you just
keep walking away? Madhi!

01:04:06.729 --> 01:04:07.768
Hi.

01:04:07.868 --> 01:04:08.893
Hi!
- Madhi!

01:04:09.427 --> 01:04:11.603
They asked me to collect
the RS Ashram cheque.

01:04:11.627 --> 01:04:12.627
One second.

01:04:13.427 --> 01:04:14.427
Hey!
- Madhi!

01:04:15.287 --> 01:04:16.529
Nice earrings.
- Thank you.

01:04:18.568 --> 01:04:19.810
Madhi!
- Here you go.

01:04:20.084 --> 01:04:21.084
I'll take that.

01:04:22.904 --> 01:04:25.123
Hey, are you going to hand over
that cheque or not?

01:04:27.732 --> 01:04:30.584
Answer what I ask first,
and then I will give it.

01:04:31.771 --> 01:04:32.560
Never mind.

01:04:32.584 --> 01:04:33.912
Keep the cheque yourself.
- Madhi!

01:04:41.169 --> 01:04:42.318
This guy!

01:04:52.282 --> 01:04:53.391
Are you out of your mind?

01:04:53.509 --> 01:04:54.909
You shouldn't come in here.
Get out!

01:04:56.201 --> 01:04:57.827
Then answer the question
I asked.

01:04:57.976 --> 01:05:00.336
I'll decide whether
to leave and let you know.

01:05:00.841 --> 01:05:01.753
In that case, I am leaving.

01:05:01.777 --> 01:05:03.396
Where do you think
you are going?

01:05:05.419 --> 01:05:08.451
What is the matter with you?
I have been watching you.

01:05:08.794 --> 01:05:11.552
Just because I treated you
patiently as a young lad,

01:05:12.427 --> 01:05:13.627
you are taking it way too far!

01:05:33.356 --> 01:05:34.356
Oh no, Dad!

01:05:45.490 --> 01:05:46.560
Quiet!
- What?

01:05:47.403 --> 01:05:50.294
You say Daddy's little princess
is terrified of her dad!

01:05:51.646 --> 01:05:52.602
What happened now?

01:05:52.642 --> 01:05:53.770
Just be quiet for a little while?

01:05:53.810 --> 01:05:54.810
It's your dad.

01:05:54.834 --> 01:05:56.162
Then take me out.

01:05:56.982 --> 01:05:57.982
I can't.

01:05:58.513 --> 01:05:59.654
Dad..

01:06:06.528 --> 01:06:08.310
Take me out!
Can you, or can't you?

01:06:08.755 --> 01:06:10.394
My goodness,
I'll definitely take you out.

01:06:10.418 --> 01:06:11.418
Stay quiet for a while.

01:06:17.685 --> 01:06:18.782
Sir, all the clients have arrived.

01:06:18.822 --> 01:06:19.862
The meeting is ready, sir.

01:06:22.912 --> 01:06:24.021
Did he leave?

01:06:24.427 --> 01:06:26.419
Yes, he left.
- Take a look.

01:06:33.709 --> 01:06:35.615
If you feel like this
in three minutes,

01:06:35.959 --> 01:06:37.544
how do you think I feel?

01:06:39.474 --> 01:06:41.810
My goodness, please leave now.

01:06:43.459 --> 01:06:45.287
Nice earrings, were they?

01:06:45.709 --> 01:06:49.303
If I see you flirting with her
ever again, I'll murder you!

01:06:50.544 --> 01:06:52.204
Like a decent, well-behaved man,

01:06:52.228 --> 01:06:54.334
you must remain humble
and reserved.

01:06:54.359 --> 01:06:55.982
Understood? See you!

01:07:03.880 --> 01:07:06.607
Deva, Dad isn't eating properly
or sleeping well.

01:07:07.076 --> 01:07:09.326
His blood pressure has shot up
due to stress.

01:07:09.623 --> 01:07:11.013
When will all this end?

01:07:12.943 --> 01:07:15.279
Go inside, dear.
I'll talk to him.

01:07:16.466 --> 01:07:19.755
Sir, the trial begins tomorrow.
Everything will be fine soon.

01:07:20.169 --> 01:07:21.169
Don't worry.

01:07:22.466 --> 01:07:24.255
You go ahead.
I'll talk to him and come.

01:07:31.185 --> 01:07:33.732
Sir, I understand
how difficult this is for you.

01:07:34.123 --> 01:07:36.435
Tomorrow in court,
we need your full focus.

01:07:40.005 --> 01:07:41.599
I feel so confused, Deva.

01:07:41.624 --> 01:07:43.584
I can't fully focus.

01:07:43.724 --> 01:07:46.087
Seeing people who stood by me
for thirty years

01:07:46.111 --> 01:07:48.380
turn away and avoid me

01:07:48.779 --> 01:07:51.435
breaks my heart completely,
Deva.

01:07:51.662 --> 01:07:53.654
I just can't bear it.

01:07:53.679 --> 01:07:55.303
Sir, if not for yourself,

01:07:55.328 --> 01:07:57.359
at least for your daughter,
you must stay focused.

01:07:57.654 --> 01:07:59.336
Karunakaran will do
whatever it takes

01:07:59.376 --> 01:08:00.576
to break you down.

01:08:01.630 --> 01:08:02.630
You must remain strong.

01:08:02.986 --> 01:08:05.411
Only then, sir, will we be
able to win. Understood?

01:08:07.568 --> 01:08:08.568
I understand, Deva.

01:08:16.060 --> 01:08:18.052
Look how many voice notes
I sent you!

01:08:18.802 --> 01:08:20.380
Did you reply to even one?

01:08:20.834 --> 01:08:22.084
Such arrogance!

01:08:22.623 --> 01:08:24.701
Sorry, I went a bit too far.

01:08:26.193 --> 01:08:27.193
That's all fine.

01:08:29.029 --> 01:08:30.704
Do you know
how hurtful it was when

01:08:30.728 --> 01:08:32.185
you spoke like
that about my career?

01:08:33.201 --> 01:08:34.161
Out of anger..

01:08:34.201 --> 01:08:35.974
If you're angry, will you say
whatever you please?

01:08:35.998 --> 01:08:39.646
My goodness, I was wrong.
I'm apologising, aren't I?

01:08:44.576 --> 01:08:46.216
You don't care about me at all.

01:08:48.209 --> 01:08:49.209
Shailu..

01:08:49.489 --> 01:08:50.818
It's nothing like that, Shailu.

01:08:52.075 --> 01:08:53.075
Is that so?

01:08:54.396 --> 01:08:56.036
Then what day is it today?
Go on, tell me.

01:08:57.029 --> 01:08:58.029
Your birthday?

01:08:58.849 --> 01:08:59.849
You..

01:09:00.966 --> 01:09:02.021
I don't know, you tell me.

01:09:02.982 --> 01:09:03.982
I won't tell you.

01:09:07.662 --> 01:09:08.662
Oh shit!

01:09:09.529 --> 01:09:11.177
Start the car!
- Why? What happened?

01:09:11.202 --> 01:09:12.725
I'm telling you, start the car!
- What happened?

01:09:12.749 --> 01:09:14.380
Start the car!
- All right, wait!

01:09:15.373 --> 01:09:16.373
Oh no!

01:09:19.716 --> 01:09:20.787
Madhi, why are we here?

01:09:21.709 --> 01:09:24.138
Hey, where are you going?
- Wait a second, Shailu.

01:09:25.373 --> 01:09:28.060
Hey, Madhi, where are you going?

01:09:29.372 --> 01:09:31.287
Sir, park it. Madhi..

01:09:34.935 --> 01:09:37.084
Where on earth have you
brought me, Madhi?

01:09:46.509 --> 01:09:48.752
Happy Anniversary!

01:10:23.853 --> 01:10:24.853
Happy?

01:11:34.213 --> 01:11:35.345
Eat up and leave, guys.

01:11:42.213 --> 01:11:43.213
Hey!

01:11:43.799 --> 01:11:45.359
How many more days of leave
do you have?

01:11:49.033 --> 01:11:50.033
I have to leave tomorrow.

01:11:51.978 --> 01:11:53.181
Such a buzzkill!

01:11:54.963 --> 01:11:57.322
I took leave just for this
and came here for two days.

01:12:02.095 --> 01:12:04.556
Thank you so much.
It means a lot to me.

01:12:04.814 --> 01:12:05.610
No problem.

01:12:05.634 --> 01:12:06.634
Happy, right?
- Yeah.

01:12:20.088 --> 01:12:22.306
Yazhini,
are all the points prepared?

01:12:22.744 --> 01:12:24.134
Yes, everything is ready.

01:12:29.720 --> 01:12:32.078
Sir, a question for you!
- Just one question, sir!

01:12:32.103 --> 01:12:35.259
Many people are angry
and resentful towards the bank.

01:12:35.284 --> 01:12:36.790
You support the fraud
they committed.

01:12:36.815 --> 01:12:38.055
Doesn't that feel wrong to you?

01:12:39.689 --> 01:12:42.031
If you yourself pass judgement
that the bank is at fault,

01:12:42.056 --> 01:12:43.976
why do courts, cases
and lawyers exist?

01:12:44.752 --> 01:12:45.752
Yazhini.

01:12:45.822 --> 01:12:48.478
Sir, just one more question!

01:12:51.072 --> 01:12:52.992
Yazhini, you haven't checked
social media, right?

01:12:53.041 --> 01:12:54.321
No, I haven't seen anything.
Why?

01:12:54.533 --> 01:12:55.933
Don't check it
until the trial ends.

01:12:56.752 --> 01:12:57.752
All right.

01:13:01.252 --> 01:13:02.252
Excuse me, sir.

01:13:04.924 --> 01:13:07.064
Sir, you've been invited
to felicitate

01:13:07.089 --> 01:13:09.228
the Bar Association
President today.

01:13:14.306 --> 01:13:15.306
Okay.

01:13:15.681 --> 01:13:17.814
You two file this case today.

01:13:18.119 --> 01:13:21.111
Ensure the hearing date
falls within two to three days.

01:13:21.361 --> 01:13:22.361
Okay, sir.
- Okay, Dad.

01:13:24.791 --> 01:13:25.791
Dad..

01:13:26.986 --> 01:13:28.586
We're heading to court anyway,
aren't we?

01:13:30.009 --> 01:13:32.611
Today is Yazhu's case

01:13:33.353 --> 01:13:35.103
against Karunakaran, remember?

01:13:36.470 --> 01:13:37.674
What am I supposed
to do about that?

01:13:37.714 --> 01:13:39.783
Why don't we go
and watch her argue?

01:13:41.033 --> 01:13:42.793
You've never seen her
argue before, have you?

01:13:43.642 --> 01:13:45.759
Are you asking me
to come watch her lose?

01:13:46.127 --> 01:13:47.849
Karunakaran will tear
both of them

01:13:47.873 --> 01:13:49.595
to pieces
and walk away victorious.

01:13:52.111 --> 01:13:54.228
Do you think I'll enjoy seeing
my daughter fail?

01:13:55.267 --> 01:13:56.642
With all due respect, Dad,

01:13:57.189 --> 01:13:58.580
I've seen her argue.

01:13:59.986 --> 01:14:01.066
You are the one who hasn't.

01:14:01.244 --> 01:14:03.443
So now you, like your sister,

01:14:03.467 --> 01:14:05.338
think you know
far more than I do?

01:14:06.377 --> 01:14:07.377
Dad,

01:14:07.884 --> 01:14:09.408
Karunakaran lost to me,
didn't he?

01:14:09.603 --> 01:14:10.997
I was the one who trained you!

01:14:11.021 --> 01:14:12.408
You speak as if
you've forgotten.

01:14:12.799 --> 01:14:14.157
Who trained Yazhini?

01:14:14.595 --> 01:14:16.588
Regardless, Yazhini
is Raj Sekar's daughter.

01:14:17.509 --> 01:14:19.111
She doesn't like
losing either, Dad.

01:14:20.174 --> 01:14:21.174
Maybe.

01:14:21.939 --> 01:14:23.818
But to defeat Karunakaran,

01:14:23.842 --> 01:14:25.720
Yazhini doesn't have
the capability yet.

01:14:27.299 --> 01:14:29.113
In fact, how Karunakaran argues

01:14:29.137 --> 01:14:31.283
is something Yazhini
knows nothing about.

01:14:31.619 --> 01:14:33.255
Karunakaran wouldn't even bother

01:14:33.280 --> 01:14:35.338
to take a beginner
like Yazhini seriously.

01:14:35.363 --> 01:14:37.671
So this case was decided
before it even started.

01:14:37.695 --> 01:14:38.695
You know it too.

01:14:39.447 --> 01:14:40.447
The problem is

01:14:40.947 --> 01:14:43.916
both of you confuse
emotion with profession.

01:14:44.259 --> 01:14:46.470
That's why you can't see
the bigger picture.

01:14:48.314 --> 01:14:50.322
You're vastly underestimating
Yazhini, Dad.

01:14:52.424 --> 01:14:54.767
Shailu, I have a lot of work.

01:14:55.240 --> 01:14:58.154
Please don't waste my time.
- What if Yazhini wins?

01:14:59.119 --> 01:15:00.644
What if she proves
you are wrong?

01:15:01.064 --> 01:15:02.733
So you're challenging me now?

01:15:06.619 --> 01:15:07.619
All right.

01:15:08.181 --> 01:15:11.228
Since you insist this much,
I will come with you.

01:15:12.174 --> 01:15:13.689
Super, Dad! Let's go.

01:15:13.900 --> 01:15:16.259
I'm not coming to see
Yazhini's talent.

01:15:16.284 --> 01:15:18.384
I will sit in court and explain
step by step

01:15:18.408 --> 01:15:20.447
how she is going to lose.

01:15:20.666 --> 01:15:22.767
Let's see who is right
and who is not.

01:15:26.697 --> 01:15:27.806
Thank you, sir.

01:15:38.749 --> 01:15:40.747
'What must I do
for you to accept'

01:15:40.772 --> 01:15:43.460
'that I can become
a good lawyer?'

01:15:52.726 --> 01:15:54.593
'Karunakaran will
tear both of them'

01:15:54.617 --> 01:15:56.484
'to pieces and walk away
victorious.'

01:18:05.365 --> 01:18:07.842
Shailu said your hearing
is scheduled for today.

01:18:09.037 --> 01:18:10.178
Good luck to you.

01:18:11.646 --> 01:18:12.670
Thanks, Dad.

01:18:19.936 --> 01:18:20.936
All set?

01:18:21.576 --> 01:18:22.576
I suppose so.

01:18:24.225 --> 01:18:25.576
Argue with confidence.

01:18:25.904 --> 01:18:27.584
Everything will fall into place,
all right?

01:18:28.006 --> 01:18:29.342
Right, see you at the trial.

01:18:30.928 --> 01:18:32.208
I have a little surprise
for you.

01:18:32.428 --> 01:18:33.506
What is it?

01:18:34.498 --> 01:18:35.498
See you!

01:19:07.342 --> 01:19:08.342
Yazhini.

01:19:08.912 --> 01:19:10.248
Hi.
- Hi.

01:19:16.076 --> 01:19:17.796
Close your eyes
and touch one of my fingers.

01:19:18.709 --> 01:19:20.849
What for?
- Just do as I say. Touch one.

01:19:23.381 --> 01:19:24.381
Keep your eyes closed.

01:19:27.459 --> 01:19:28.459
Trust me.

01:19:37.990 --> 01:19:40.647
What were we able to establish
at today's hearing?

01:19:42.748 --> 01:19:45.678
That ₹300 crore

01:19:47.498 --> 01:19:49.303
released by HCF Bank
to 50 companies

01:19:49.843 --> 01:19:52.466
was transferred
to the Wellstone Trust

01:19:53.234 --> 01:19:54.246
within 48 hours.

01:19:54.319 --> 01:19:55.359
Correct.

01:19:55.686 --> 01:19:56.686
Now, the next.

01:19:58.287 --> 01:20:00.272
Must I touch another finger?

01:20:01.865 --> 01:20:03.365
What do we currently suspect?

01:20:04.201 --> 01:20:07.186
There is a link between
Wellstone Trust

01:20:07.211 --> 01:20:09.225
and those 50 companies,

01:20:09.263 --> 01:20:11.529
but we are unable to figure out
what it actually is.

01:20:12.772 --> 01:20:13.772
Good.

01:20:14.014 --> 01:20:15.045
And lastly..

01:20:15.584 --> 01:20:18.397
What if the trust proves
these donations to be valid?

01:20:18.490 --> 01:20:19.523
How could that be?

01:20:19.547 --> 01:20:22.068
Loans granted
to 50 bogus companies

01:20:23.498 --> 01:20:24.736
being transferred entirely

01:20:24.836 --> 01:20:28.146
to a single trust
within 48 hours.

01:20:28.303 --> 01:20:30.183
That doesn't seem like
a mere coincidence to me.

01:20:30.553 --> 01:20:33.506
Their accounts
must be audited, Deva.

01:20:36.873 --> 01:20:37.873
Now open your eyes.

01:20:40.943 --> 01:20:41.943
There you are.

01:20:42.693 --> 01:20:43.693
You're ready to go.

01:20:52.248 --> 01:20:53.248
Thanks.

01:20:55.975 --> 01:20:58.175
Can't tell if this was kept out
yesterday or made today.

01:20:58.897 --> 01:20:59.897
What do you want?

01:21:01.154 --> 01:21:02.154
Oh no!

01:21:02.302 --> 01:21:04.031
What brings you around here,
Veni?

01:21:04.326 --> 01:21:05.326
Just like that.

01:21:05.607 --> 01:21:09.287
I came to inspect
the food quality in the canteen.

01:21:09.312 --> 01:21:10.312
Oh!

01:21:10.990 --> 01:21:12.030
Did you see that, Sudalai?

01:21:12.428 --> 01:21:14.708
The moment she became President,
she forgot her past ties!

01:21:14.795 --> 01:21:17.615
Not at all. She's only doing
her duty. Carry on, ma'am.

01:21:17.693 --> 01:21:19.123
Even that looks expired, see!
- Hey!

01:21:19.148 --> 01:21:20.148
Sir, an egg puff, please.

01:21:25.435 --> 01:21:26.295
Here.
- Thank you, ma'am.

01:21:26.319 --> 01:21:27.724
The tissues are over there.
- Okay, ma'am.

01:21:27.748 --> 01:21:28.732
Look at that.

01:21:28.756 --> 01:21:30.693
Mr. Sathyan!
- Sathyan?

01:21:30.718 --> 01:21:32.388
She is usurping
every single duty of yours!

01:21:32.412 --> 01:21:33.421
What will you do
if she snatches this job too?

01:21:33.445 --> 01:21:35.811
Hey, go away!
- Are we overdoing it a bit?

01:21:37.709 --> 01:21:39.314
You wanted
a ₹2,000 raise, right?

01:21:39.338 --> 01:21:40.338
I'll deal with you.

01:21:42.029 --> 01:21:43.334
What is all this, Veni?

01:21:44.490 --> 01:21:45.490
Well,

01:21:46.068 --> 01:21:49.131
Mr. Sathyan hardly visits
the chambers these days.

01:21:49.631 --> 01:21:51.231
So I thought I would come by
and see you.

01:21:51.889 --> 01:21:54.316
You are no longer your old self.

01:21:54.341 --> 01:21:56.256
You are the President now.
You must be swamped with work.

01:21:56.296 --> 01:21:58.779
I felt I shouldn't disturb you,
which is why I sent Sudalai.

01:21:59.334 --> 01:22:02.217
Sudalai, if you bring the tea
from now on,

01:22:02.404 --> 01:22:04.170
you will lose your job
in this canteen!

01:22:04.342 --> 01:22:06.022
Sir, a cup of tea, please!
- What did I do?

01:22:07.818 --> 01:22:09.225
You are crossing the line.

01:22:13.177 --> 01:22:15.075
Veni, everyone is watching.

01:22:15.100 --> 01:22:16.443
I could not care less
about that.

01:22:16.568 --> 01:22:19.201
Look here. I am still
the same Veni from before.

01:22:19.514 --> 01:22:21.684
Spending two minutes
bringing me tea

01:22:21.709 --> 01:22:23.100
is not going to change anything.

01:22:24.045 --> 01:22:27.014
So stop acting like such a saint
and come along.

01:22:28.170 --> 01:22:30.693
Ma'am, Mr. RS is arriving
at the office.

01:22:30.718 --> 01:22:32.153
He says he wants to meet
the new President.

01:22:32.193 --> 01:22:33.405
I'll be right there. Carry on.

01:22:33.430 --> 01:22:34.430
Very well, ma'am.

01:22:44.459 --> 01:22:46.059
Well, well!
Look who we have here, Manoj!

01:22:47.576 --> 01:22:48.576
Hello, people!

01:22:49.522 --> 01:22:51.362
Have you all been keeping up
with social media?

01:22:52.272 --> 01:22:54.208
People can say whatever
they please on social media,

01:22:54.248 --> 01:22:56.404
but in a court of law,
only evidence matters.

01:22:57.576 --> 01:22:59.529
Oh! Is that so?
Evidence matters, does it?

01:22:59.967 --> 01:23:01.951
Manoj, make sure
you learn all this!

01:23:04.919 --> 01:23:06.647
Do you know what I admire
most about you?

01:23:07.482 --> 01:23:09.381
Your confidence,
your commitment,

01:23:09.406 --> 01:23:11.623
body language
and that gutsy behaviour!

01:23:12.413 --> 01:23:13.693
You should learn this too, dear!

01:23:13.858 --> 01:23:16.061
Yazhini, once you win
this hearing,

01:23:17.038 --> 01:23:19.045
do you think your dad
will bring you into RSK?

01:23:21.506 --> 01:23:22.561
I was only joking!

01:23:24.998 --> 01:23:27.147
I shall take my leave.
All the best!

01:23:51.092 --> 01:23:52.092
Does it hurt?

01:23:55.038 --> 01:23:56.827
Dad, shall we go
to the hospital?

01:23:57.452 --> 01:23:58.881
No need for any of that, dear.

01:23:59.365 --> 01:24:01.125
You never listen
when I ask you to quit work.

01:24:01.827 --> 01:24:03.780
Standing on your feet
for hours at this age!

01:24:06.170 --> 01:24:07.574
Muthu, do you realise

01:24:07.674 --> 01:24:10.193
how much I struggled
to make you a lawyer?

01:24:10.873 --> 01:24:12.356
Look here,
seeing you become a lawyer

01:24:12.436 --> 01:24:14.021
brings this family
far more pride

01:24:14.101 --> 01:24:15.800
than it brings even you!

01:24:16.014 --> 01:24:17.827
How many times have I told you?

01:24:17.852 --> 01:24:20.359
Control your temper,
don't be hasty,

01:24:20.459 --> 01:24:21.620
and remain patient.

01:24:22.006 --> 01:24:23.873
Did you pay any heed?
Now look where

01:24:24.248 --> 01:24:26.524
your short temper
and impulsiveness

01:24:26.624 --> 01:24:28.251
have landed you!

01:24:28.366 --> 01:24:31.577
It has brought you to the brink
of disciplinary action!

01:24:31.896 --> 01:24:34.819
Who asked you to go pick a fight
with that Pandiyaraj?

01:24:35.030 --> 01:24:37.069
You know very well
what sort of man he is!

01:24:37.295 --> 01:24:39.254
Did you give our family
even a moment's thought?

01:24:39.354 --> 01:24:40.604
Dad..

01:24:41.159 --> 01:24:42.173
What are you on about, Dad?

01:24:45.163 --> 01:24:47.003
Did a single soul
in that court offer me a job?

01:24:48.280 --> 01:24:49.323
How many people did I approach,

01:24:49.363 --> 01:24:50.723
begging to be taken on
as a junior?

01:24:52.702 --> 01:24:55.647
They all brushed me aside
as a mere peon's son!

01:24:57.108 --> 01:24:58.228
Ms. Veni was the only person

01:24:59.038 --> 01:25:00.889
who respected my capability
and gave me an opportunity.

01:25:00.913 --> 01:25:01.993
Now that she is in trouble,

01:25:02.420 --> 01:25:04.020
how could I just stand
by and do nothing?

01:25:04.600 --> 01:25:06.160
How could I not stand up
in her support?

01:25:07.022 --> 01:25:08.190
Standing by her was right!

01:25:08.214 --> 01:25:09.877
I understand that, my boy.

01:25:10.061 --> 01:25:12.739
However, the disciplinary action
being brought against you

01:25:12.764 --> 01:25:14.604
is because you laid hands
on someone, isn't it?

01:25:16.186 --> 01:25:19.897
What was the hurry to go
and hit him like that?

01:25:20.655 --> 01:25:22.811
Dad, he misbehaved
with Keerthana.

01:25:25.295 --> 01:25:26.483
Who is this Keerthana?

01:25:30.577 --> 01:25:31.819
Your love interest?

01:25:33.678 --> 01:25:35.100
Aren't you running late
for work?

01:25:35.897 --> 01:25:36.897
Get going.

01:25:37.044 --> 01:25:38.592
Eat quickly and remember to take
your medication properly.

01:25:38.616 --> 01:25:40.241
Does that girl love you back,
dear?

01:25:40.561 --> 01:25:42.217
What a crucial question
to ask right now!

01:25:48.288 --> 01:25:49.288
What is it?

01:25:53.779 --> 01:25:54.779
Hello, Veni.

01:26:01.069 --> 01:26:02.623
Congrats!
- Thank you.

01:26:12.952 --> 01:26:15.032
I wondered where you were.
I haven't seen you around.

01:26:15.217 --> 01:26:17.077
Welcome, Sathyan.
- Tell me, sir.

01:26:17.717 --> 01:26:20.437
This is your first visit here since
the election results, isn't it?

01:26:21.584 --> 01:26:23.586
If you have any grievances,

01:26:24.004 --> 01:26:25.724
feel free to drop them
in the complaint box.

01:26:26.592 --> 01:26:27.584
Very funny!

01:26:27.608 --> 01:26:29.968
Sitting in that chair makes one
speak like this, doesn't it?

01:26:30.264 --> 01:26:31.264
Splendid!

01:26:31.483 --> 01:26:33.116
I have no desire
to occupy this position.

01:26:33.514 --> 01:26:34.697
I am merely the person
who decides

01:26:34.737 --> 01:26:35.937
who gets to sit in that chair.

01:26:36.170 --> 01:26:37.450
You know that very well,
Sathyan.

01:26:37.655 --> 01:26:39.842
Your decision seems to have gone
terribly wrong, sir.

01:26:41.100 --> 01:26:43.340
I merely came to look at
that very mistake in judgement.

01:26:43.623 --> 01:26:46.077
Righteousness is whatever serves
your convenience, isn't it?

01:26:46.264 --> 01:26:49.608
Sathyan,
power cannot surpass justice.

01:26:50.272 --> 01:26:51.919
I trust you understand
that quite clearly now, sir.

01:26:51.959 --> 01:26:53.053
The thing is

01:26:53.209 --> 01:26:55.678
that very power can purchase
any kind of justice.

01:26:56.069 --> 01:26:58.631
How are you still so confident
even after a defeat, sir?

01:26:59.327 --> 01:27:01.608
An influential man never truly
faces defeat, Sathyan.

01:27:02.413 --> 01:27:05.788
You know well that Raj Sekar
didn't reach this stature overnight.

01:27:06.233 --> 01:27:07.965
The one who preaches
righteousness

01:27:07.990 --> 01:27:09.430
is the unfortunate one,
always alone.

01:27:09.475 --> 01:27:11.708
Those with power will always
have a crowd rallying behind them.

01:27:11.748 --> 01:27:14.928
Having a crowd behind
doesn't guarantee victory.

01:27:16.100 --> 01:27:18.553
True, but amidst
the roar of that crowd,

01:27:18.578 --> 01:27:19.655
the truth often gets lost.

01:27:24.334 --> 01:27:26.366
What if that very truth begins
speaking from within your home,

01:27:26.390 --> 01:27:28.327
louder than your own voice?

01:27:30.030 --> 01:27:32.569
Then your voice will be
silenced completely,

01:27:32.905 --> 01:27:34.592
Mr. Raj Sekar.

01:27:38.623 --> 01:27:39.623
That's a good one!

01:27:40.452 --> 01:27:41.452
Keep trying.

01:27:48.741 --> 01:27:50.803
'This must be
our senior's house.'

01:27:51.163 --> 01:27:53.288
'Look at it.
It looks completely run-down!'

01:27:53.545 --> 01:27:55.178
Is this Muthu's house?
Are you certain?

01:27:55.584 --> 01:27:56.537
It has to be this one.

01:27:56.577 --> 01:27:58.896
One can tell at a glance,
it's hardly a royal palace!

01:27:59.225 --> 01:28:00.225
Go on and ask, senior!

01:28:00.287 --> 01:28:01.577
'Why did I even
bring you along?'

01:28:02.038 --> 01:28:03.806
Did we come all this way
just to stand and stare?

01:28:03.830 --> 01:28:04.975
Go and ask, senior!

01:28:11.413 --> 01:28:12.413
Hey!

01:28:12.889 --> 01:28:15.412
Won't it look odd if we suddenly
go and knock on the door?

01:28:15.452 --> 01:28:17.168
Are we here to propose
a marriage alliance?

01:28:17.208 --> 01:28:18.810
He was reckless,
got suspended,

01:28:18.835 --> 01:28:20.014
and that suspension
has now been revoked.

01:28:20.054 --> 01:28:21.396
We came to deliver
the revocation letter.

01:28:21.436 --> 01:28:23.044
Go and knock, senior! Go on!

01:28:24.069 --> 01:28:25.116
Why do I even share things
with you?

01:28:25.140 --> 01:28:25.994
Come on, senior!

01:28:26.034 --> 01:28:27.725
Young man! Who are you?

01:28:28.233 --> 01:28:30.178
Is this lawyer Muthu's house,
sir?

01:28:30.810 --> 01:28:32.952
Yes, this is the one.
And you are?

01:28:33.319 --> 01:28:36.030
We both work with him.
I'm Viswa, and she's Keerthana.

01:28:38.084 --> 01:28:39.873
So you are Keerthana, dear?

01:28:41.747 --> 01:28:42.747
Yes.

01:28:42.850 --> 01:28:44.106
Come in, please! Do come inside!

01:28:44.130 --> 01:28:45.280
Does his dad know about you?

01:28:45.373 --> 01:28:46.893
Don't fool around.
- Okay, come inside.

01:28:49.764 --> 01:28:51.389
Senior, do you know?

01:28:51.608 --> 01:28:53.811
Muthu's grandfather,
great-grandfather, dad,

01:28:53.889 --> 01:28:55.842
they are all court peons!
It's a peon dynasty!

01:28:56.053 --> 01:28:57.983
Just stay quiet!
- Here, take this.

01:28:58.272 --> 01:28:59.312
You hand it over yourself.

01:29:00.030 --> 01:29:01.975
Muthu! Hey!

01:29:03.881 --> 01:29:05.655
Dad, haven't you left
for court yet?

01:29:06.027 --> 01:29:07.000
We can go later.

01:29:07.024 --> 01:29:08.998
A girl named Keerthana
has come looking for you!

01:29:09.670 --> 01:29:10.670
Don't fool around, Dad!

01:29:11.053 --> 01:29:12.976
I am irritated enough as it is.
- Listen to what I say!

01:29:13.000 --> 01:29:14.967
Come here!
- Dad, what on earth?

01:29:18.733 --> 01:29:20.053
Hi!
- Hi, senior.

01:29:22.913 --> 01:29:23.913
Why did you come here?

01:29:24.295 --> 01:29:26.288
Why? Aren't we allowed to visit?

01:29:27.178 --> 01:29:28.795
If I say no,
will you just head back?

01:29:28.820 --> 01:29:29.570
Shut up!

01:29:29.594 --> 01:29:31.594
Sir, I have never seen
a court peon's house before.

01:29:31.795 --> 01:29:33.690
Could you show me around?
- Come along, dear!

01:29:33.714 --> 01:29:34.761
Why me between them!

01:29:35.811 --> 01:29:36.811
What is the matter?

01:29:37.522 --> 01:29:38.819
I need to talk to you.

01:29:41.373 --> 01:29:43.108
What is this?
- Read it and see.

01:29:55.092 --> 01:29:57.030
Hey! How did this happen?

01:30:11.186 --> 01:30:12.295
Did Ms. Veni win?

01:30:12.873 --> 01:30:14.131
Yes.
- What are you saying?

01:30:16.100 --> 01:30:19.045
So from now on,
you can come to court as usual.

01:30:24.053 --> 01:30:26.389
Here, my dear, have some coffee.
- Thank you, auntie.

01:30:26.811 --> 01:30:28.803
Mom, this is Keerthana.

01:30:29.178 --> 01:30:30.218
Keerthana, this is my mom.

01:30:31.389 --> 01:30:32.600
So you are Keerthana, dear?

01:30:35.178 --> 01:30:36.178
Yes, auntie.

01:30:36.514 --> 01:30:37.629
Does she know about you?

01:30:37.654 --> 01:30:39.242
I'll splash it
right in your face!

01:30:39.266 --> 01:30:40.272
Be quiet.

01:30:40.839 --> 01:30:44.380
Mom, they will be having lunch with
us today. Please prepare something.

01:30:44.404 --> 01:30:46.044
Did you really need
to tell me that, dear?

01:30:46.191 --> 01:30:47.573
He is always like this, dear.

01:30:47.794 --> 01:30:50.403
Oh, no, auntie!
We ate before coming here!

01:30:50.428 --> 01:30:51.700
No, dear.
- Never mind that.

01:30:51.856 --> 01:30:53.864
We'll all eat together today!
- Dad..

01:30:55.302 --> 01:30:57.552
He told me everything!

01:30:57.577 --> 01:30:58.645
You told them?

01:30:58.670 --> 01:31:00.081
I had already eaten,

01:31:00.106 --> 01:31:01.340
but hearing you mention food
makes me hungry all over again!

01:31:01.364 --> 01:31:02.896
Where is the kitchen? Let's go!
- Yes, come on.

01:31:02.920 --> 01:31:04.000
Come along, dear!
- Come in!

01:31:04.411 --> 01:31:05.411
We have everything ready!

01:31:06.731 --> 01:31:07.731
Right, come along.

01:32:30.994 --> 01:32:33.103
Mr. Velmurugan..

01:32:34.276 --> 01:32:36.534
A fortnight ago, in your branch,

01:32:37.042 --> 01:32:39.577
you initiated a legal audit,
did you not? - Yes.

01:32:40.006 --> 01:32:41.486
Why? What was the reason
for doing so?

01:32:41.513 --> 01:32:44.862
As you know, in the ATM robbery
case that occurred a while ago,

01:32:44.987 --> 01:32:48.776
a member of our bank staff
leaked sensitive information.

01:32:48.801 --> 01:32:50.418
Whenever security lapses occur,

01:32:50.443 --> 01:32:52.886
conducting such an audit
is standard banking procedure.

01:32:54.924 --> 01:32:58.809
Upon discovering illegal loan
approvals in this audit,

01:32:58.848 --> 01:32:59.831
what action did you take?

01:32:59.855 --> 01:33:02.125
I informed my higher officials

01:33:02.149 --> 01:33:03.893
and formally filed
a police complaint

01:33:03.993 --> 01:33:05.082
at the station.

01:33:09.190 --> 01:33:12.073
My Lord,
this is the complaint copy.

01:33:17.323 --> 01:33:20.121
My Lord,
this clearly shows that the bank

01:33:20.145 --> 01:33:22.463
has been transparent
in its processes.

01:33:22.628 --> 01:33:24.158
Apart from Jafer
and Dhanaseelan,

01:33:24.229 --> 01:33:26.534
we do not know how many others
are behind this case.

01:33:26.559 --> 01:33:28.067
However, as far as
this scam is concerned,

01:33:28.107 --> 01:33:30.549
the bank is a victim,
not a perpetrator.

01:33:31.362 --> 01:33:35.026
Therefore, I request
this court to lift

01:33:35.221 --> 01:33:38.838
the operational restrictions
imposed on HCF Bank.

01:33:46.534 --> 01:33:47.534
Did you see that?

01:33:48.096 --> 01:33:49.846
What a formidable
opening argument!

01:33:51.604 --> 01:33:54.245
She should not have presented
the GM as the first witness.

01:33:55.280 --> 01:33:56.280
Why?

01:33:57.542 --> 01:33:59.674
All 50 files bear
his signature alone.

01:34:02.519 --> 01:34:05.113
Velmurugan, right?
- Yes, sir.

01:34:06.253 --> 01:34:08.472
These 50 loan application files

01:34:08.773 --> 01:34:10.141
bear your signature,
do they not?

01:34:10.917 --> 01:34:11.917
Yes, sir. But...

01:34:11.942 --> 01:34:13.847
These ifs and buts
will not hold here.

01:34:14.160 --> 01:34:15.988
Simply answer the question
put to you.

01:34:16.013 --> 01:34:18.214
Yes or no.
- Yes, sir.

01:34:18.239 --> 01:34:19.239
Thank you.

01:34:20.105 --> 01:34:21.628
Let us talk about another file.

01:34:22.652 --> 01:34:23.964
Do you recall a Mr. Varghese?

01:34:25.332 --> 01:34:27.464
He applied for a loan of ₹5 lakh.

01:34:28.183 --> 01:34:29.925
Did you approve it or reject it?

01:34:30.477 --> 01:34:31.489
No, sir.

01:34:31.577 --> 01:34:33.785
The collateral was not in order,
so I rejected it.

01:34:34.707 --> 01:34:36.191
Please note this point,
Your Honour.

01:34:36.457 --> 01:34:38.324
Collateral.
- Objection, My Lord!

01:34:40.003 --> 01:34:42.589
We have already submitted
to this court that Jafer misled

01:34:42.667 --> 01:34:44.589
Velmurugan into signing
those documents, My Lord.

01:34:44.614 --> 01:34:46.582
Karunakaran,
please stick to the point.

01:34:52.206 --> 01:34:54.371
My Lord,
please examine this file.

01:34:56.792 --> 01:34:58.726
This is the ₹5 lakh loan file

01:34:58.750 --> 01:35:00.683
of an ordinary man, Mr. Varghese,

01:35:00.752 --> 01:35:03.229
rejected by the bank
citing a lack of collateral.

01:35:03.777 --> 01:35:04.777
Yet this very same bank

01:35:05.211 --> 01:35:07.747
disbursed loans worth

01:35:07.985 --> 01:35:10.997
₹300 crore to 50 companies

01:35:11.583 --> 01:35:14.021
with absolutely
no discrepancies!

01:35:14.536 --> 01:35:17.006
This cannot be dismissed
as mere negligence, My Lord.

01:35:17.031 --> 01:35:18.748
No, My Lord!
I swear upon my daughter,

01:35:18.773 --> 01:35:20.213
I did not do this knowingly,
My Lord!

01:35:23.193 --> 01:35:24.193
Mr. GM,

01:35:24.755 --> 01:35:26.945
taking oaths won't carry
any weight here.

01:35:27.045 --> 01:35:28.159
This is a court.

01:35:28.259 --> 01:35:29.583
Just answer the question
put to you.

01:35:30.677 --> 01:35:31.677
Thank you.

01:35:33.279 --> 01:35:36.044
My Lord, this is a clear
open-and-shut case.

01:35:36.740 --> 01:35:38.982
The bank attempted a blame game

01:35:39.466 --> 01:35:41.716
merely to cover up its failure.
That is all.

01:35:42.138 --> 01:35:43.743
Yet the fact remains

01:35:43.843 --> 01:35:45.804
that the bank is still
the prime suspect.

01:35:45.990 --> 01:35:47.919
There is absolutely
no doubt about that.

01:35:47.944 --> 01:35:49.154
Objection, My Lord!

01:35:53.224 --> 01:35:57.474
If, as my learned friend claims,
the bank is at fault,

01:35:58.201 --> 01:36:01.794
should the money not have gone
to the bank's employees?

01:36:02.365 --> 01:36:03.645
Yet that is not what transpired!

01:36:07.943 --> 01:36:11.701
All that money went to a charity
named the Wellstone Trust!

01:36:11.802 --> 01:36:13.193
This is the counter-attack, Dad!

01:36:15.826 --> 01:36:18.154
Yazhini has nothing
beyond that name.

01:36:24.154 --> 01:36:26.449
What connection does
Wellstone Trust

01:36:26.549 --> 01:36:27.908
have with this loan?

01:36:29.974 --> 01:36:31.849
Karunakaran must have
realised it by now.

01:36:32.419 --> 01:36:33.633
In the next two minutes,

01:36:33.733 --> 01:36:35.764
the case will be
done and dusted.

01:36:41.224 --> 01:36:43.412
There is no established
connection as such.

01:36:43.701 --> 01:36:47.982
Okay. Do you at least know where
the money went from that trust?

01:36:50.138 --> 01:36:51.352
That is precisely
what we need time..

01:36:51.376 --> 01:36:53.263
You don't know it.
Allow me to explain, My Lord.

01:36:54.068 --> 01:36:56.568
To salvage its reputation,
the bank created an illusion

01:36:56.888 --> 01:37:01.029
that several unknown parties
were behind this scam.

01:37:01.544 --> 01:37:04.255
First, a retired bank employee.

01:37:04.396 --> 01:37:06.020
Second, an auditor.

01:37:06.528 --> 01:37:10.036
And now, finally,
a charitable trust!

01:37:10.341 --> 01:37:14.958
And all of this without a shred
of concrete evidence, My Lord!

01:37:15.810 --> 01:37:16.810
Shailu..

01:37:17.904 --> 01:37:18.904
it's game over.

01:37:19.396 --> 01:37:20.875
And please note one more thing.

01:37:20.900 --> 01:37:23.017
Mr. Jafer,
who processed these loans,

01:37:23.451 --> 01:37:25.489
and the GM, who approved
and signed them,

01:37:25.888 --> 01:37:29.263
are both employees of HCF Bank.

01:37:29.904 --> 01:37:33.745
The only entity competent
to investigate this matter

01:37:33.770 --> 01:37:35.261
is HCF Bank.

01:37:35.771 --> 01:37:37.626
If they conduct a proper inquiry,

01:37:37.650 --> 01:37:40.013
they can easily trace
where the ₹300 crore went.

01:37:41.037 --> 01:37:43.701
However, whether they will do so
remains questionable.

01:37:44.677 --> 01:37:46.365
As the prosecution
stated earlier,

01:37:47.130 --> 01:37:49.866
had the bank strictly
adhered to all procedures

01:37:49.966 --> 01:37:51.460
as per protocol,

01:37:51.732 --> 01:37:55.208
this situation would
never have arisen, My Lord.

01:37:56.146 --> 01:37:57.146
That is all, My Lord.

01:37:59.372 --> 01:38:00.810
Thank you, My Lord.

01:38:03.388 --> 01:38:05.951
Based on the facts
presented thus far,

01:38:06.005 --> 01:38:08.712
it is evident
that several procedural lapses

01:38:08.812 --> 01:38:10.060
occurred on the bank's part.

01:38:10.085 --> 01:38:12.005
It has not been
concretely proven

01:38:12.029 --> 01:38:14.576
that Wellstone Trust
has any connection to this case.

01:38:14.654 --> 01:38:17.057
Therefore, until
this investigation concludes,

01:38:17.081 --> 01:38:18.545
the operational restrictions

01:38:18.585 --> 01:38:20.066
imposed on the bank
shall continue.

01:38:20.166 --> 01:38:22.551
The next hearing date is
the last week of this month.

01:38:36.662 --> 01:38:38.083
The court is adjourned.

01:39:06.747 --> 01:39:07.747
Are you okay?

01:39:22.662 --> 01:39:24.342
A father naturally wishes
that his daughter

01:39:24.599 --> 01:39:27.372
should not suffer
or be humiliated before others.

01:39:28.497 --> 01:39:29.497
It is only natural.

01:39:31.185 --> 01:39:32.945
That is why I advised
against taking this up,

01:39:33.646 --> 01:39:34.646
but you would not listen.

01:39:36.052 --> 01:39:37.052
It is fine.

01:39:37.708 --> 01:39:39.083
You said you wanted to try.

01:39:40.208 --> 01:39:41.208
That is enough.

01:39:41.896 --> 01:39:43.216
Now at least listen
to what I say.

01:39:43.701 --> 01:39:45.716
Leave all of this behind
and come back home.

01:39:52.115 --> 01:39:53.115
Dad..

01:39:56.943 --> 01:39:58.427
One step at a time.

01:40:00.255 --> 01:40:01.560
One punch at a time.

01:40:02.529 --> 01:40:05.185
And one round at a time.

01:40:07.490 --> 01:40:08.599
What I fought today was

01:40:09.747 --> 01:40:10.747
Round One.

01:40:13.255 --> 01:40:16.552
I am not someone
who gives up so easily, Dad.

